ge plugins\nalready packaged as dynamic artifacts at ghcr.io/redhat-developer/\nrhdh-plugin-export-overlays) without needing per-adopter allowedSources\noverrides. Same for ghcr.io/butlerdotdev (the future first-party publish\nlocation).\n\nSetting allowedSources: [] explicitly restores the pre-0.5.4 permissive\ndefault for adopters who need that.\n\nTest updated to assert the new defaults are present plus a new test\ncovering the empty-list opt-out.","tree":{"sha":"c13c39240d9520683fef23436d9c126235ad6453","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/git/trees/c13c39240d9520683fef23436d9c126235ad6453"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/git/commits/7bc0092be5c5da4745d915a618d9592ec8b7b581","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/commit/7bc0092be5c5da4745d915a618d9592ec8b7b581","node_id":"C_kwDORPLoK9oAKDdiYzAwOTJiZTVjNWRhNDc0NWQ5MTVhNjE4ZDk1OTJlYzhiN2I1ODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/commit/325898aff0fa198126bca1d3393b5d17877f2a14","sha":"325898aff0fa198126bca1d3393b5d17877f2a14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/commits/325898aff0fa198126bca1d3393b5d17877f2a14"}],"sha":"7bc0092be5c5da4745d915a618d9592ec8b7b581","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/commits/7bc0092be5c5da4745d915a618d9592ec8b7b581"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46534421?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atbagan","id":46534421,"login":"atbagan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTM0NDIx","organizations_u