r_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46534421?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atbagan","id":46534421,"login":"atbagan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTM0NDIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/commits/32baa91a6bc5ff55e3a9572d458c8ca2e60536a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T02:47:15Z","email":"agtbstunts@gmail.com","name":"atbagan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T02:47:15Z","email":"agtbstunts@gmail.com","name":"atbagan"},"message":"docs(dynamic-plugins): write the rest of the section against the verified path\n\nSix new pages matching the quickstart''s depth/tone and grounded in\nthe chart 0.5.2 / live-showcase verified path:\n\n* backend-wiring.md (sidebar 2): the three patterns from the\n  quickstart in depth (Backstage proxy, bundled backend dynamic\n  plugin, direct external). Concrete fetchApi/discoveryApi shapes,\n  the auth model, when to pick which.\n* authoring.md (sidebar 3): file structure for frontend and backend\n  dynamic plugins, the src/index.ts re-export contract, the\n  dynamicPluginsExports schema in use, permissions framework,\n  testing locally.\n* publishing.md (sidebar 4): packing the dist-dynamic into a\n  package/ tarball, computing sha512 SRI (Linux base64 -w0 caveat\n  inline), oras push, registry support matrix, versioning\n  conventions, the no-signing-yet honest scope.\n* chart-config.md (sidebar 5): every dynamicPlugins values knob,\n  the operator-empowerment framing for the security model\n  (allowedSources + integrity + continueOnError as control you have,\n  not restriction imposed), revert-don''t-fix-forward recovery, the\n  chart 0.5.0-0.5.1 path bug history for upgraders.\n* example.md (sidebar 6): line-by-line walkthrough of dynamic-\n  plugin-hello + dynamic-plugin-hello-backend mapped against what the\n  reader sees on the live butler-portal-live showcase. The pair is\n  CI-tested by example-build-test on every PR touching them.\n* reference.md (sidebar 7): the runtime contract the portal commits\n  to. /remotes endpoint shape, host singleton table (including the\n  MUI v4 split), dynamicPluginsExports schema, backend plugin\n  loader, installer contract, failure-mode table.\n\nThe example-build-test workflow is verified to build BOTH the\nfrontend example AND the backend example green on real amd64\n(workflow_dispatch run 27520830267).\n\nEvery command in every page is from the verified path: monorepo-\nisolation temp-dir build, rhdh-cli plugin export, the package/\ntarball pack, sha512 SRI with -w0, oras push, the chart 0.5.2\nvalues block. Adopter-reality gotchas (monorepo isolation, MUI v4\nstyles split, host singletons, chart 0.5.0-0.5.1 path bug) are\ndocumented inline where the adopter would otherwise rediscover them.\n\n@module-federation/runtime is the mechanism throughout. Scalprum is\nonly mentioned to call out that Butler Portal does not use it (so\nRHDH-docs readers are not confused).\n\nOpen-product framing woven through: operator decides, defaults are\nhygiene not gating, no-fork version-bump is the value prop. The\nsecurity model in chart-config is operator-empowerment language\n(you control your supply chain) not restriction (the chart imposes\nrules).","tree":{"sha":"c7172e558e4ea6af392610ea989725de108ea87c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/git/trees/c7172e558e4ea6af392610ea989725de108ea87c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/git/commits/32baa91a6bc5ff55e3a9572d458c8ca2e60536a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46534421?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atbagan","id":46534421,"login":"atbagan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTM0NDIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/commit/32baa91a6bc5ff55e3a9572d458c8ca2e60536a0","node_id":"C_kwDORPLoK9oAKDMyYmFhOTFhNmJjNWZmNTVlM2E5NTcyZDQ1OGM4Y2EyZTYwNTM2YTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/commit/d6017f5336e3eeb34fb6e9ced79ca309d2488934","sha":"d6017f5336e3eeb34fb6e9ced79ca309d2488934","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/commits/d6017f5336e3eeb34fb6e9ced79ca309d2488934"}],"sha":"32baa91a6bc5ff55e3a9572d458c8ca2e60536a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/commits/32baa91a6bc5ff55e3a9572d458c8ca2e60536a0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46534421?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atbagan","id":46534421,"login":"atbagan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTM0NDIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/commits/d6017f5336e3eeb34fb6e9ced79ca309d2488934/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T02:27:13Z","email":"agtbstunts@gmail.com","name":"atbagan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T02:27:13Z","email":"agtbstunts@gmail.com","name":"atbagan"},"message":"docs(dynamic-plugins): chart 0.5.2 references + live showcase pointer\n\nThe first live-cutover attempt against chart 0.5.1 surfaced a chart-\nside path bug (init container mounted dynamic-plugins volume at\n/opt/butler-portal/dynamic-plugins, installer hardcodes /dynamic-\nplugins-root, CrashLoopBackOff on init mkdir). Chart 0.5.2 fixes the\npath on all three template references (init mount, env value, main\nmount) and pins it with a new unittest. The portal image stays at\nappVersion 0.5.1; only the chart bumps.\n\nDoc updates:\n* Prereq table now reads ''chart 0.5.2+'' with a one-line note\n  explaining why 0.5.1 does not work (so an adopter who pulled the\n  released 0.5.1 chart understands the failure mode without filing).\n* Install command uses --version 0.5.2.\n* README ''when right'' framing updated to chart 0.5.2+ with the image\n  version called out for clarity.\n\nA live showcase pointer lands at the top of the quickstart: the\nbutler-portal-live production portal at portal.butlerlabs.dev ships\nthe canonical example pair as an installed dynamic plugin. An adopter\nopening the docs can navigate to /hello-dynamic-plugin and see a\nworking dynamic plugin before they read another line. The page they\nsee is built from the same examples/ directory this quickstart tells\nthem to copy.","tree":{"sha":"9fdb511aaa5d92ee548f7b7264d05deb1cb575f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/git/trees/9fdb511aaa5d92ee548f7b7264d05deb1cb575f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/git/commits/d6017f5336e3eeb34fb6e9ced79ca309d2488934","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46534421?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atbagan","id":46534421,"login":"atbagan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTM0NDIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/commit/d6017f5336e3eeb34fb6e9ced79ca309d2488934","node_id":"C_kwDORPLoK9oAKGQ2MDE3ZjUzMzZlM2VlYjM0ZmI2ZTljZWQ3OWNhMzA5ZDI0ODg5MzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/commit/6cf407363c746a54f538b732cb47bb42d9bb8e14","sha":"6cf407363c746a54f538b732cb47bb42d9bb8e14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/commits/6cf407363c746a54f538b732cb47bb42d9bb8e14"}],"sha":"d6017f5336e3eeb34fb6e9ced79ca309d2488934","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/commits/d6017f5336e3eeb34fb6e9ced79ca309d2488934"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46534421?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atbagan","id":46534421,"login":"atbagan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTM0NDIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/commits/6cf407363c746a54f538b732cb47bb42d9bb8e14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T00:29:57Z","email":"agtbstunts@gmail.com","name":"atbagan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T00:29:57Z","email":"agtbstunts@gmail.com","name":"atbagan"},"message":"fix(chart): match dynamicPlugins volume path to installer default\n\nChart 0.5.0-0.5.1 mounted the dynamic-plugins volume at\n/opt/butler-portal/dynamic-plugins in both the init container and the\nmain container, and set APP_CONFIG_dynamicPlugins_rootDirectory to\nthe same path. The butler-portal-plugin-installer:0.1.0 binary mkdirs\n/dynamic-plugins-root on startup and ignores both the YAML ''root:''\nkey and any --root flag. A live cutover that set dynamicPlugins.\nenabled=true CrashLoopBackOff''d on:\n\n  mkdir: cannot create directory ''/dynamic-plugins-root'':\n  Permission denied\n  event=startup root=/dynamic-plugins-root reason=root_uncreatable\n\nThe init container''s filesystem had no writable directory at the\ninstaller''s hardcoded path, the populated volume was somewhere else,\nand the install step failed before any plugin was extracted. The\nrelease-boot-test, run-051-marker-test, and run-051-backend-test\nscripts all happened to mount the volume AT /dynamic-plugins-root\n(matching the installer default), so the bug never surfaced in CI.\n\nChart 0.5.2 changes the path on all three sides of the wiring (init\ncontainer volumeMount, main container env value, main container\nvolumeMount) to /dynamic-plugins-root so the installer''s default\nmatches the chart''s mount. appVersion stays 0.5.1 -- the portal\nimage is unchanged.\n\nA new chart test pins the init container volumeMount specifically to\n/dynamic-plugins-root with a comment quoting the live-cutover failure\nthat motivated it. The disabled-state snapshot stays valid (this\nchange only affects the enabled-state pod template; disabled-state\npod env + mounts are unchanged and remain byte-identical to chart\n0.4.0).","tree":{"sha":"3b74b3eabc30fb91841e84f20b0357d9aa00acea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/git/trees/3b74b3eabc30fb91841e84f20b0357d9aa00acea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/git/commits/6cf407363c746a54f538b732cb47bb42d9bb8e14","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46534421?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atbagan","id":46534421,"login":"atbagan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTM0NDIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/commit/6cf407363c746a54f538b732cb47bb42d9bb8e14","node_id":"C_kwDORPLoK9oAKDZjZjQwNzM2M2M3NDZhNTRmNTM4YjczMmNiNDdiYjQyZDliYjhlMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/commit/ba06647c7697819fdf82eaf0c3def02d3b7e2824","sha":"ba06647c7697819fdf82eaf0c3def02d3b7e2824","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/commits/ba06647c7697819fdf82eaf0c3def02d3b7e2824"}],"sha":"6cf407363c746a54f538b732cb47bb42d9bb8e14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/commits/6cf407363c746a54f538b732cb47bb42d9bb8e14"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46534421?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atbagan","id":46534421,"login":"atbagan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTM0NDIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/commits/ba06647c7697819fdf82eaf0c3def02d3b7e2824/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T23:41:19Z","email":"agtbstunts@gmail.com","name":"atbagan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T23:41:19Z","email":"agtbstunts@gmail.com","name":"atbagan"},"message":"feat(example): enrich hello fixtures into a live showcase + new integrity\n\nThe hello fixtures grow from minimal marker-only test fodder into a\ndeliberate FE+BE showcase suitable for permanent deployment on\nbutler-portal-live. The CI marker string is preserved verbatim\n(''Hello from the Butler Portal dynamic-plugins runtime'' under\ndata-testid=''hello-dynamic-plugin-marker'' for the frontend, the\nliteral substring ''...(backend)'' in the backend /ping JSON for the\nrelease-boot-test), so existing boot-test and example-build-test\nassertions continue to pass without modification.\n\nWhat''s new for the visual showcase:\n\nFrontend (examples/dynamic-plugin-hello/src/components/HelloPage.tsx):\n* MUI v4 Card layout with metadata chips (plugin name, version,\n  ''loaded: runtime''), the source OCI URI, and a ''Read the source''\n  link to the example on GitHub.\n* The marker string lives inside a styled Box so the visitor sees it\n  as the centerpiece, not raw debug output.\n* A ''Ping the bundled backend'' button that fetches\n  /api/hello-dynamic-backend/ping and renders the JSON response.\n* Error path renders inline with a clear pointer to the chart-values\n  cause (missing backend plugin in dynamicPlugins.plugins[]).\n\nBackend (examples/dynamic-plugin-hello-backend/src/plugin.ts):\n* /ping response gains plugin name/version, backend-started-at, the\n  per-request received-at timestamp, the pod hostname, the node\n  version, and a short explanatory note. The marker substring stays\n  for the release-boot-test grep.\n\nNew integrity values (sha512 SRI) pushed to the same OCI tags:\n* hello-dynamic-0.5.1 -> sha512-bdd/gEtWJpDnCbf86jAZoYYuKnj...\n* hello-dynamic-backend-0.5.1 -> sha512-+jHUltsqu4RVZzK1S93...\n\nBoot-test scripts and release-boot-test workflow defaults updated to\nthe new integrity values so the CI assertions run against the\nshowcase artifacts.","tree":{"sha":"07fe6d34e5d68b443c399f8d74113c7a584b98b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/git/trees/07fe6d34e5d68b443c399f8d74113c7a584b98b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/butlerdotdev/butler-portal/git/commits/ba06647c7697819fdf82eaf0c3def02d3b7e2824","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46534421?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atbagan","id":46534421,"login":"atbagan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTM0NDIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atbagan","user_view_type":"public"},"ht