484307db597","sha":"4de3e45e17e63dcd63e3a7ffa0b6d484307db597","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Feloguarin/jason-silva-ai-demo/commits/4de3e45e17e63dcd63e3a7ffa0b6d484307db597"}],"sha":"ebc643b2753f0e578d043ca4988c24000cd4275c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Feloguarin/jason-silva-ai-demo/commits/ebc643b2753f0e578d043ca4988c24000cd4275c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Feloguarin/jason-silva-ai-demo/commits/4de3e45e17e63dcd63e3a7ffa0b6d484307db597/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-16T00:56:15Z","email":"onigiri@srv1312041.hstgr.cloud","name":"Onigiri"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-16T00:56:15Z","email":"onigiri@srv1312041.hstgr.cloud","name":"Onigiri"},"message":"🏗️ Split pipeline into single-call endpoints (Hobby plan fix)\n\nProblem: Vercel Hobby = 60s timeout. Long-form generation made 5+\nsequential API calls in one request, timing out.\n\nSolution: Frontend orchestrates the pipeline step by step:\n\nScript generation:\n  1. POST /api/longform/outline → single Anthropic call (~5s)\n  2. POST /api/longform/section → one per section (~8s each)\n\nVoice synthesis:\n  1. POST /api/voice/split → split text into chunks (instant)\n  2. POST /api/voice/chunk → one ElevenLabs call per chunk (~8s)\n  3. Stitching happens in-browser (no ffmpeg, no server concat)\n\nEach request = one API call = well within 60s.\nReal-time progress: ''Writing section 3 of 7...''\nWorks on Vercel Hobby plan. No Pro needed.","tree":{"sha":"310076cf561473913d99de75ee3769aeb0ae760b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Feloguarin/jason-silva-ai-demo/git/trees/310076cf561473913d99de75ee3769aeb0ae760b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Feloguarin/jason-silva-ai-demo/git/commits/4de3e45e17e63dcd63e3a7ffa0b6d484307db597","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Feloguarin/jason-silva-ai-demo/commit/4de3e45e17e63dcd63e3a7