hesis → Crescendo → Landing\n- Quote deduplication across sections (20 thinker pool)\n- Chunked voice synthesis with ffmpeg crossfade stitching\n- New endpoints: /api/generate-longform, /api/voice-longform\n- UI: Duration options up to 45 minutes\n- CLI mode: python longform_engine.py ''topic'' --duration 45 --output script.md --voice audio.mp3\n- Tested: 10-min generation produces ~1300 words, 4 sections, 6 unique quotes","tree":{"sha":"9f5f8a50c5e05f4c90816dd6f67dd73ea2393066","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Feloguarin/jason-silva-ai-demo/git/trees/9f5f8a50c5e05f4c90816dd6f67dd73ea2393066"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Feloguarin/jason-silva-ai-demo/git/commits/8895bd461d34b831fa7ca229966ed006609fde79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Feloguarin/jason-silva-ai-demo/commit/8895bd461d34b831fa7ca229966ed006609fde79","node_id":"C_kwDORPLzn9oAKDg4OTViZDQ2MWQzNGI4MzFmYTdjYTIyOTk2NmVkMDA2NjA5ZmRlNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Feloguarin/jason-silva-ai-demo/commit/0d6ce7e30c527b1428cd00468b9ade6507988ce1","sha":"0d6ce7e30c527b1428cd00468b9ade6507988ce1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Feloguarin/jason-silva-ai-demo/commits/0d6ce7e30c527b1428cd00468b9ade6507988ce1"}],"sha":"8895bd461d34b831fa7ca229966ed006609fde79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Feloguarin/jason-silva-ai-demo/commits/8895bd461d34b831fa7ca229966ed006609fde79"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Feloguarin/jason-silva-ai-demo/commits/0d6ce7e30c527b1428cd00468b9ade6507988ce1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-14T03:14:47Z","email":"onigiri@srv1312041.hstgr.cloud","name":"Onigiri"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-14T03:14:47Z","email":"onigiri@srv1312041.hstgr.cloud","name":"Onigiri"},"message":"chore: clean up project structure, update README, improve gitignore","tree":{"sha":"38f45c859cad0cc11d29bfcdedd