ly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/b76d4f4dec379a8e8f5a3a19fb896f9208872706/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T18:36:40Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T18:36:40Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"feat(M7): ocultar UI de estudio de mercado hasta activar flag público\n\nLa UI de estudio de mercado (pestaña Mercado, baremos, zone study) queda\ndetrás de NEXT_PUBLIC_PRICING_MARKET_STUDY_UI=true. Sin la variable, el\ndeploy de Vercel expone loader global, cartera, informe clásico y el\nresto del backend sin pantallas del estudio de mercado.\n\n- pricing-tabs: oculta enlace a /platform/pricing/mercado\n- mercado/page: redirige a cartera si el flag está apagado\n- informe: oculta precio óptimo y zone study en pestaña Análisis\n- AnalysisProcessingCard sigue visible (no depende del flag)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"08d96b3430a31ca3c0f8f552a0caef244e29bcdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/08d96b3430a31ca3c0f8f552a0caef244e29bcdf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/b76d4f4dec379a8e8f5a3a19fb896f9208872706","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/b76d4f4dec379a8e8f5a3a19fb896f9208872706","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKGI3NmQ0ZjRkZWMzNzlhOGU4ZjVhM2ExOWZiODk2ZjkyMDg4NzI3MDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/bcc0d2b62fb28613756975779d1d1e4eb4987d78","sha":"bcc0d2b62fb28613756975779d1d1e4eb4987d78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/bcc0d2b62fb28613756975779d1d1e4eb4987d78"}],"sha":"b76d4f4dec379a8e8f5a3a19fb896f9208872706","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/b76d4f4dec379a8e8f5a3a19fb896f9208872706"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/bcc0d2b62fb28613756975779d1d1e4eb4987d78/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T18:19:19Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T18:19:19Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"refactor(M0): aislar consumer:market del barrel del consumer general\n\nEl worker dedicado a Market ya no arrastra agentes LLM, integraciones\nWhatsApp ni el resto de la app: el registry de handlers se extrae a un\nmodulo puro y run-consumer carga via dynamic import solo los handlers\ncorrespondientes al modo activo.\n\n- registry.ts nuevo: estructuras y register/get sin side effects ni\n  imports de handlers concretos.\n- consumer.ts lee getHandler/getJobHandler desde registry (corta la\n  cadena que arrastraba todo).\n- handlers.ts y job-handlers.ts mantienen sus side effects pero usan el\n  registry compartido (re-exportan register* para compatibilidad).\n- market-job-handlers.ts nuevo: registra solo los 8 MARKET_* del\n  consumer dedicado, sin tocar el resto del codigo.\n- index.ts del barrel sigue importando handlers + job-handlers para\n  conservar el comportamiento historico de /api/cron/consumer y tests.\n- run-consumer.ts importa runConsumerLoop desde ./consumer y carga\n  handlers por dynamic import segun modo (market = solo Market).\n- contract-instruction-graph.ts pasa a inicializacion lazy del LLM\n  estructurado como defensa adicional (no se evalua en import time).\n\nValidado: tsx scripts/run-consumer.ts --market-mode arranca sin\nOPENAI_API_KEY ni BETTER_AUTH_SECRET y solo falla al conectar a DB.\nTests del consumer (9/9) pasan sin cambios.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"88e7ae5577d820c94fc1f4455280311557b634d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/88e7ae5577d820c94fc1f4455280311557b634d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/bcc0d2b62fb28613756975779d1d1e4eb4987d78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"u