ps://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/71f74c47dced8a721cd5e71060f590886929239c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T13:29:12Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T13:29:12Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"feat(M5): automatizar cruces de demanda y trazabilidad completa en conversaciones\n\nActiva matching interno y contacto NLU al crear/modificar demandas en el worker.\nRegistra envíos WhatsApp en Event Store para auditar comprador/comercial en Conversaciones.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"02bf42cb72a6761c36dea4bfad01cc5eb41eb1fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/02bf42cb72a6761c36dea4bfad01cc5eb41eb1fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/71f74c47dced8a721cd5e71060f590886929239c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/71f74c47dced8a721cd5e71060f590886929239c","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKDcxZjc0YzQ3ZGNlZDhhNzIxY2Q1ZTcxMDYwZjU5MDg4NjkyOTIzOWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/6c42e7a5ffbd27496698d0e069ba1b80f335beff","sha":"6c42e7a5ffbd27496698d0e069ba1b80f335beff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/6c42e7a5ffbd27496698d0e069ba1b80f335beff"}],"sha":"71f74c47dced8a721cd5e71060f590886929239c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/71f74c47dced8a721cd5e71060f590886929239c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/6c42e7a5ffbd27496698d0e069ba1b80f335beff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T13:18:31Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T13:18:31Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"fix(M3): reencolar crawl-seed cuando worker rechaza por CONCURRENCY_LIMIT\n\nEl cliente del Market Worker trataba todas las respuestas `accepted` igual\ny marcaba el job como `COMPLETED`. Eso es correcto cuando el worker rebota\ncon `DEADLINE_EXCEEDED` (la extracción sigue corriendo en background y el\nworker actualizará el `MarketCrawlRun` al terminar), pero es incorrecto\npara `CONCURRENCY_LIMIT`: en ese caso el extractor nunca arrancó, así que\nsi lo marcamos `COMPLETED` el job se pierde y el `MarketCrawlRun`\nasociado queda huérfano en `RUNNING`.\n\nPatrón observado en producción: cuando `discoverDueSeeds` encola 8 seeds\ny el worker tiene `MAX_CONCURRENT_BROWSERS=2`, solo 2 jobs se ejecutan\nrealmente. Los otros 6 se rechazaban por `CONCURRENCY_LIMIT` y quedaban\nmarcados como completados, dejando 6 runs huérfanos por tick y cero\nitems capturados en los seeds rechazados (incluido Fotocasa).\n\nCambios:\n- `lib/job-queue`: nuevo helper `requeueJob` que devuelve un job\n  `IN_PROGRESS` a `PENDING` sin penalizar `attempts` (los decrementa\n  para revertir el incremento del `dequeueJob`). Aplica retry-delay\n  configurable (default 5s) y registra el motivo en `lastError`.\n- `lib/market/scheduler.ts`: `runCrawlTick` distingue las dos razones\n  de `accepted`. Para `CONCURRENCY_LIMIT` reencola con jitter 1-6s; el\n  `MarketCrawlRun` se conserva (el `runId` sigue en el payload y el\n  worker lo retomará en el próximo intento exitoso).\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"a4d820cebc0add7fa9a0844eed8992075e37ede0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/a4d820cebc0add7fa9a0844eed8992075e37ede0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/6c42e7a5ffbd27496698d0e069ba1b80f335beff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/6c42e7a5ffbd27496698d0e069ba1b80f335beff","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKDZjNDJlN2E1ZmZiZDI3NDk2Njk4ZDBlMDY5YmExYjgwZjMzNWJlZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/a87a31a30a7ea5d63e21a36729131c9a8cc8cd67","sha":"a87a31a30a7ea5d63e21a36729131c9a8cc8cd67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/a87a31a30a7ea5d63e21a36729131c9a8cc8cd67"}],"sha":"6c42e7a5ffbd27496698d0e069ba1b80f335beff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/6c42e7a5ffbd27496698d0e069ba1b80f335beff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gi