y14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T11:53:05Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"fix(M6): servir imágenes de oportunidades vía proxy\n\nLa vista cargaba imágenes directas de los CDNs y fallaba según la IP cliente.\nAhora enruta por /api/statefox/image y habilita imghs.net para Pisos.com.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd801b7ccdba6eadb071c689bfdf32b3187520b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/fd801b7ccdba6eadb071c689bfdf32b3187520b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/9f85407e98043451e35e08b4dde7fccf8699dd52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/9f85407e98043451e35e08b4dde7fccf8699dd52","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKDlmODU0MDdlOTgwNDM0NTFlMzVlMDhiNGRkZTdmY2NmODY5OWRkNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/6f37bd50c1730795fa1bfc22f4d7595a3fbf260d","sha":"6f37bd50c1730795fa1bfc22f4d7595a3fbf260d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/6f37bd50c1730795fa1bfc22f4d7595a3fbf260d"}],"sha":"9f85407e98043451e35e08b4dde7fccf8699dd52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/9f85407e98043451e35e08b4dde7fccf8699dd52"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/6f37bd50c1730795fa1bfc22f4d7595a3fbf260d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T11:32:49Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T11:32:49Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"chore(M0): copiar lib/prisma, lib/idealista y lib/fotocasa en imagen Docker del market-worker\n\n`lib/scraping/browser.ts` (que el worker usa via\n`createScrapingBrowserKit` en `idealista-residential.ts` y otros\nfetchers) importa con alias `@/lib/idealista/browser`,\n`@/lib/idealista/config` y `@/lib/fotocasa/config`. Esos directorios\nno se copiaban a la imagen, asi que el worker arrancaba pero\ncrasheaba en runtime la primera vez que abria Playwright.\n\n`lib/prisma.ts` se incluye tambien por defensa: con el refactor lazy\ndel commit anterior la API legacy de warm-session ya no lo carga al\nimportar el modulo, pero si alguna ruta (Statefox legacy invocada\nindirectamente, etc.) terminara invocandola, la imagen ya lo tiene.\n\nActualizar tambien la nota del Dockerfile para listar la cadena\nactual de imports `@/lib/...` que arrastra el worker en runtime.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c547b51e58fa108cbb88e163ce017d7a7d71a93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/3c547b51e58fa108cbb88e163ce017d7a7d71a93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/6f37bd50c1730795fa1bfc22f4d7595a3fbf260d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/6f37bd50c1730795fa1bfc22f4d7595a3fbf260d","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKDZmMzdiZDUwYzE3MzA3OTVmYTFiZmMyMmY0ZDc1OTVhM2ZiZjI2MGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/c92dbe73bc811f25acaa52195da89c1013997f40","sha":"c92dbe73bc811f25acaa52195da89c1013997f40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/c92dbe73bc811f25acaa52195da89c1013997f40"}],"sha":"6f37bd50c1730795fa1bfc22f4d7595a3fbf260d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/6f37bd50c1730795fa1bfc22f4d7595a3fbf260d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/c92dbe73bc811f25acaa52195da89c1013997f40/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T11:32:24Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T11:32:24Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"fix(M0): cargar @/lib/prisma de forma lazy en API legacy de warm-session\n\nCausa raiz del crash del Market Worker en Railway:\n\n  Error: Cannot find module ''@/lib/prisma''\n  Require stack:\n    /app/lib/scraping/warm-session/acquire.ts\n    /app/lib/scraping/warm-session/index.ts\n    /app/workers/market-worker/src/fetchers/idealista-residential.ts\n\n`acquire.ts` y `repo.ts` instanciaban en top-level un `defaultAcquire` /\n`defaultRepo` ligados al `prisma` singleton del monolito (`@/lib/prisma`).\nEl Market Worker NO usa esa API legacy (inyecta su propio PrismaClient\nvia `createWarmSessionAcquire`/`createWarmSessionRepo`), pero al\nimportar `lib/scraping/warm-session/index.ts` el modulo `acquire.ts` se\ncargaba y resolvia `@/lib/prisma` aunque nunca se invocara, lo que\ncrasheaba el contenedor del worker que no incluye ese fichero.\n\nRefactor: convertir las funciones legacy a `async` que resuelven\n`@/lib/prisma` con `import()` dinamico la primera vez que alguien las\ninvoca y memoizan el repo/acquire resultante. Asi:\n\n- El Market Worker importa el modulo sin tocar `@/lib/prisma`.\n- Statefox y los CLI del monolito (que SI usan la API legacy) siguen\n  funcionando sin cambios; ya hacian `await acquireWarmSession(...)`\n  porque la firma siempre fue `Promise<T>`.\n- vitest puede seguir interceptando con `vi.mock(\"@/lib/prisma\", ...)`,\n  porque `import()` dinamico pasa por el resolver de Vite igual que\n  `import` estatico (a diferencia de `require()`, que no se intercepta).\n\nTests: 9/9 lib/scraping/warm-session OK (3 acquire legacy + 3 acquire\ninyectado + 3 policy), 24/24 workers/market-worker/src/fetchers OK.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"c016f7664fedb0bc61ac45cfb5d024d7e6dbbdf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/c016f7664fedb0bc61ac45cfb5d024d7e6dbbdf2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/c92dbe73bc811f25acaa52195da89c1013997f40","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events