soragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"82c6fcfb94afaa17366f0a50c2ecc0ab2c0643f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/82c6fcfb94afaa17366f0a50c2ecc0ab2c0643f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/e1535aa8021a9bdce05dd65dec96e8dce8cb31a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/e1535aa8021a9bdce05dd65dec96e8dce8cb31a7","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKGUxNTM1YWE4MDIxYTliZGNlMDVkZDY1ZGVjOTZlOGRjZThjYjMxYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/2000ab9a865f7b51953339b31bfc401594dc70b5","sha":"2000ab9a865f7b51953339b31bfc401594dc70b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/2000ab9a865f7b51953339b31bfc401594dc70b5"}],"sha":"e1535aa8021a9bdce05dd65dec96e8dce8cb31a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/e1535aa8021a9bdce05dd65dec96e8dce8cb31a7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/2000ab9a865f7b51953339b31bfc401594dc70b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T18:16:02Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T18:16:02Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"feat(M4): programar nota de encargo con QStash y endpoints dedicados\n\nMigra el flujo de Nota de Encargo a envío en caliente con QStash:\nlos cuatro pasos temporales (recordatorio 2h antes, check-confirmacion\n30 min antes, formulario en el instante de la visita y matching-check\nN días después) se publican directamente como mensajes diferidos en\nQStash con notBefore = <instante objetivo> y se entregan a endpoints\ndedicados, sin pasar por job_queue ni esperar a un cron poller.\n\n- Funciones puras idempotentes en lib/nota-encargo/send.ts que respetan\n  la transición de estados y encadenan recordatorio -> check via QStash.\n- Helpers de publicación en lib/nota-encargo/schedule.ts y combo\n  scheduleNotaEncargoInitialSteps (recordatorio + matching-check).\n- Endpoints POST /api/nota-encargo/{recordatorio,check-confirmacion,\n  formulario,matching-check} autenticados con firma Upstash + CRON_SECRET\n  como fallback.\n- Webhook (nota_encargo_confirmo) publica el formulario en QStash en vez\n  de encolar el job NOTA_ENCARGO_ENVIAR_FORMULARIO.\n- Endpoint admin POST /api/admin/nota-encargo/migrate-to-qstash y script\n  scripts/migrate-nota-encargo-to-qstash.ts para drenar el remanente de\n  jobs legacy en job_queue tras el despliegue.\n- Script scripts/force-send-nota-encargo.ts para rescate puntual.\n- Handlers legacy en lib/workers/consumer/nota-encargo-handlers.ts\n  conservados como red de seguridad: delegan en send.ts.\n- Fix crítico en proxy.ts: whitelist de las rutas QStash de Nota de\n  Encargo y Parte de Visita (y admin migrate-to-qstash). Sin esto el\n  middleware redirigía a /login y QStash recibía 307/405.\n- Documentación en docs/productos/nota-encargo-impl.md y .env.example.\n\nTests:\n- lib/nota-encargo/__tests__/nota-encargo-handlers.test.ts y\n  webhook-handler.test.ts actualizados para mockear los publishers de\n  QStash en lugar de enqueueJob.\n- app/api/captacion/nota-encargo/__tests__/route.test.ts mockea\n  scheduleNotaEncargoInitialSteps.\n- 53/53 tests OK en el alcance modificado.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"18b7ae062e5eab9cc4d7f236ccf790ac4043c351","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/18b7ae062e5eab9cc4d7f236ccf790ac4043c351"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/2000ab9a865f7b51953339b31bfc401594dc70b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/