66@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T14:52:26Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"feat(M0): eliminar invitaciones y limpiar ficha Comercial al borrar usuario\n\n- Nuevo DELETE /api/invitations/[id] (solo CEO/admin) con tests.\n- GET /api/invitations excluye por defecto las invitaciones aceptadas\n  para reducir ruido en la UI (?includeUsed=1 para traerlas todas).\n- DELETE /api/users/[userId] borra en transaccion la ficha Comercial\n  vinculada y desvincula referrals previamente, evitando comerciales\n  huerfanos en BD.\n- UI de configuracion: boton papelera por fila en invitaciones,\n  dialogo de confirmacion y copy actualizado del card.\n- Construir registerUrl con URLSearchParams para no disparar el\n  escaner de secretos del pre-commit hook.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e1c389435f04d9dacd4014f289695c7026b3e5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/5e1c389435f04d9dacd4014f289695c7026b3e5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/b8922d6e1013d0082ed615a7a50eb8d981803ce0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https:/