ment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T14:40:34Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"fix(M4): permitir eliminar notas canceladas y asignar comercial desde CEO\n\nSe corrige la creacion de nota para rol ceo/admin exigiendo comercialId\nvalido y se mantiene autoasignacion para comercial. Ademas se agrega\neliminacion definitiva de notas en estado CANCELADA para reducir ruido\nvisual en la tabla de captacion.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"36b3f564b1d7ce01362af916969c7f7e54e9a756","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/36b3f564b1d7ce01362af916969c7f7e54e9a756"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/e0e865a6dd1c428e76273710ae22c45c32dcd6bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/e0e865a6dd1c428e76273710ae22c45c32dcd6bd","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKGUwZTg2NWE2ZGQxYzQyOGU3NjI3MzcxMGFlMjJjNDVjM