s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/11a12bc8d16910172b0abc3f298bfc9e6526594c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T14:20:24Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T14:20:24Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"fix(M4): zona horaria Europe/Madrid + cancelar nota de encargo\n\nTres puntos del flujo asumian la zona local del navegador o del host.\nAhora se fija explicitamente Europe/Madrid en persistencia, render y\nmensajes a WhatsApp, asi un comercial fuera de Espana o un worker en\nVercel (TZ=UTC) ven y envian la misma hora civil.\n\nSe anade NOTA_ENCARGO_CANCELADA al EventType y un endpoint dedicado\nPOST /api/captacion/nota-encargo/[id]/cancel que marca la sesion como\nCANCELADA, emite el evento y borra jobs PENDING asociados. La tabla\nahora muestra una columna con el comercial responsable y un boton para\ncancelar la nota con confirmacion.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0d2ddac5434b0dc5d1a10fcbf8b83cfa39d62ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/a0d2ddac5434b0dc5d1a10fcbf8b83cfa39d62ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/11a12bc8d16910172b0abc3f298bfc9e6526594c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/11a12bc8d16910172b0abc3f298bfc9e6526594c","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKDExYTEyYmM4ZDE2OTEwMTcyYjBhYmMzZjI5OGJmYzllNjUyNjU5NGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/fe1a454ca8f51c95f27c0fb0b951a7a4ab98753e","sha":"fe1a454ca8f51c95f27c0fb0b951a7a4ab98753e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/fe1a454ca8f51c95f27c0fb0b951a7a4ab98753e"}],"sha":"11a12bc8d16910172b0abc3f298bfc9e6526594c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/11a12bc8d16910172b0abc3f298bfc9e6526594c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/fe1a454ca8f51c95f27c0fb0b951a7a4ab98753e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T14:07:38Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T14:07:38Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"chore(scripts): herramientas de diagnostico/validacion local de market\n\nAnadir un set de scripts de operacion para validar y depurar el\npipeline de market end-to-end sin tocar produccion:\n\n- scripts/start-market-worker-local.ps1: lanzador del worker que\n  carga todo el `.env` del root antes de `npm run dev` (el dotenv\n  embebido del worker buscaba el `.env` en su propio cwd y se perdia\n  variables como MARKET_IDEALISTA_ENABLED y BRIGHTDATA_*).\n- scripts/validate-market-end-to-end.ts: orquestador que recorre el\n  pipeline completo (discover -> crawl -> normalize -> identity ->\n  diff -> snapshot) imprimiendo resumen por fase y errores top.\n- scripts/diagnose-market-state.ts: snapshot en consola de seeds,\n  raws, listings, properties y job queue agrupados por status/source.\n- scripts/diagnose-market-crawl-runs.ts: detalle de los ultimos\n  MarketCrawlRun con paginas, capturados, bloqueos y errores.\n- scripts/diagnose-cluster-by-id.ts y scripts/diagnose-listing-by-id.ts:\n  consulta directa de un cluster/listing por id para reproducir 404\n  y problemas de ficha sin pasar por la UI.\n- scripts/release-prisma-advisory-locks.ts: utilidad para liberar\n  manualmente advisory locks colgados de Neon (P1002 al hacer\n  `prisma migrate resolve` contra el pooler).\n\nTodos van bajo `scripts/` y no tocan codigo de aplicacion. Los\ndiagnose-* y validate-* aceptan args via argv y usan el mismo\nDATABASE_URL del proceso, manteniendo la regla \"lo mas cercano\nposible a produccion\" del AGENTS.md.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"7b7134ce7324d9b1eadb1997b99b42c55e97ee65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/7b7134ce7324d9b1eadb1997b99b42c55e97ee65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/fe1a454ca8f51c95f27c0fb0b951a7a4ab98753e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"htt