t_property_review_required\n\nEl timestamp 20260506163809 era anterior a 20260506180000 (la\nmigracion add_market_core que define el enum MarketEventType). Eso\nhacia que `prisma migrate deploy` fallara con P3018 al intentar\nanadir el value MARKET_PROPERTY_REVIEW_REQUIRED a un enum aun\ninexistente.\n\nRenombrar el directorio a 20260506180100 para que se aplique\ninmediatamente despues de add_market_core, manteniendo el SQL\noriginal y el orden logico de las migraciones.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"597fb94d504629941848c1549b93e4bf9e8b264c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/597fb94d504629941848c1549b93e4bf9e8b264c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/2431114bdefcd63a07783d74dc866b4fd402b651","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/2431114bdefcd63a07783d74dc866b4fd402b651","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKDI0MzExMTRiZGVmY2Q2M2EwNzc4M2Q3NGRjODY2YjRmZDQwMmI2NTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/98b3a1bd2a711f71d6ccd3380d68450f8dd7266a","sha":"98b3a1bd2a711f71d6ccd3380d68450f8dd7266a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/98b3a1bd2a711f71d6ccd3380d68450f8dd7266a"}],"sha":"2431114bdefcd63a07783d74dc866b4fd402b651","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/2431114bdefcd63a07783d74dc866b4fd402b651"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/98b3a1bd2a711f71d6ccd3380d68450f8dd7266a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T14:07:02Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T14:07:02Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"fix(M0): copiar lib/scraping en imagen Docker del market-worker\n\nEl worker importa `lib/scraping/web-unlocker/client` con paths\nrelativos (../../../../lib/...). Sin la copia explicita la imagen\narrancaba pero crasheaba en runtime con MODULE_NOT_FOUND la primera\nvez que intentaba usar Bright Data Web Unlocker (Idealista,\ndetail-fetch reintentado, etc.).\n\nAnadir tambien una nota en el Dockerfile recordando que cualquier\nnuevo import a `lib/<otro>/...` desde el worker requiere su `COPY`\ncorrespondiente.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"b844f475bd6ad36631f8b3b7467e955e01c2a3ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/b844f475bd6ad36631f8b3b7467e955e01c2a3ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/98b3a1bd2a711f71d6ccd3380d68450f8dd7266a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/98b3a1bd2a711f71d6ccd3380d68450f8dd7266a","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKDk4YjNhMWJkMmE3MTFmNzFkNmNjZDMzODBkNjg0NTBmOGRkNzI2NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/d4e2b2544cf313012617be41eb0528f0bbe33710","sha":"d4e2b2544cf313012617be41eb0528f0bbe33710","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/d4e2b2544cf313012617be41eb0528f0bbe33710"}],"sha":"98b3a1bd2a711f71d6ccd3380d68450f8dd7266a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/98b3a1bd2a711f71d6ccd3380d68450f8dd7266a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/d4e2b2544cf313012617be41eb0528f0bbe33710/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T14:06:46Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T14:06:46Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"fix(M-market): decodificar id en rutas de ficha de propiedad\n\nNext.js 15 entrega el dynamic segment sin decodificar (`%3A` no se\nconvierte a `:`), por lo que un id `virtual:<listingId>` llegaba como\n`virtual%3A<listingId>` a `getPropertyCluster`. La rama de listings\nhuerfanos no se activaba, la consulta caia al else, no encontraba\nninguna `MarketProperty` con ese id raro y la pagina respondia 404.\n\nAplicar `decodeURIComponent` al id en:\n- /platform/market/properties/[id]/page.tsx (ficha cross-portal)\n- /api/market/properties/[id] (cluster JSON)\n- /api/market/properties/[id]/timeline (timeline JSON)\n\nSin esto, todos los listings sin propertyId (los que aun no han pasado\npor MARKET_RESOLVE_IDENTITY) eran inalcanzables desde la UI de\noportunidades, aunque existieran en la base de datos.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"9ee28e790a2efa0b0c1a936bf0d9cadf24252ade","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/9ee28e790a2efa0b0c1a936bf0d9cadf24252ade"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/d4e2b2544cf313012617be41eb0528f0bbe33710","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/d4e2b2544cf313012617be41eb0528f0bbe33710","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKGQ0ZTJiMjU0NGNmMzEzMDEyNjE3YmU0MWViMDUyOGYwYmJlMzM3MTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/u