:"2026-05-14T12:58:50Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"fix(M0): incluir prisma CLI en market-worker para build en Railway\n\nAñade `prisma` como dependencia del worker para que `npx --no-install prisma generate`\nfuncione durante el build Docker con `npm ci --omit=dev`, evitando el fallo por paquete faltante.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"28d2945ce85bd4d7114fe3f8f9adec83d8f68767","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/28d2945ce85bd4d7114fe3f8f9adec83d8f68767"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/044444b42a4830c53233aba084a2f9ed85b21a7b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/044444b42a4830c53233aba084a2f9ed85b21a7b","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKDA0NDQ0NGI0MmE0ODMwYzUzMjMzYWJhMDg0YTJmOWVkODViMjFhN2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/22b67674ceacc43133ef9f0bbd2bc22a86901cb2","sha":"22b67674ceacc43133ef9f0bbd2bc22a86901cb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/22b67674ceacc43133ef9f0bbd2bc22a86901cb2"}],"sha":"044444b42a4830c53233aba084a2f9ed85b21a7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/044444b42a4830c53233aba084a2f9ed85b21a7b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/22b67674ceacc43133ef9f0bbd2bc22a86901cb2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:39:26Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:39:26Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"Merge branch ''chore/M0-archive-scraping-portales'' into main\n\nMVP Core Mercado — Statefox in-house mejorado, listo para deploy a Railway.\n\nTrae la base completa del Core Mercado (modelos, scraping, identity,\nnormalize, scheduler, jobs, market-worker en workers/) que aún no estaba\nen main, más los 9 commits del MVP construidos encima:\n\n- Schema y migraciones aditivas (resolución de eventos, captacion failure\n  reason, alertas guardadas, listing image cache, JobType nuevo).\n- Backend de clusters cross-portal (lib/market/properties + 3 endpoints).\n- Cola de revisión humana de identidad (/platform/market/identity/review).\n- Ficha dedicada de propiedad y kanban de captación con drag&drop.\n- Dashboard de mercado con KPIs y evolución €/m².\n- Alertas guardadas con entrega in-app (Notification + Pusher) y\n  WhatsApp (template configurable WHATSAPP_TEMPLATE_MARKET_ALERT).\n- Image cache lazy con worker MARKET_IMPORT_LISTING_IMAGES (default\n  solo Idealista, configurable con MARKET_IMAGE_IMPORT_PORTALS).\n- Reemplazo Statefox→MarketListing en pricing/microsite con feature\n  flag MARKET_PRICING_SOURCE (statefox | market) y fallback.\n- UI de oportunidades migrada a clusters MarketProperty con badges.\n- Build fix menores en módulos pre-existentes para destrabar `next build`.\n\nValidaciones previas al merge:\n- npx prisma generate: OK.\n- npm run build: OK (Next 16.1.6 + Turbopack).\n- npm test: 198/198 tests del módulo market OK; los 59 fallos restantes\n  son pre-existentes en archivos no tocados por este MVP\n  (whatsapp-nlu-handler-postventa, microsite-flow-e2e, contracts).\n\nConfiguración externa requerida en Railway/Vercel antes del primer\ncrawl real (no es código): BRIGHTDATA_API_TOKEN, BRIGHTDATA_WEB_UNLOCKER_ZONE,\nMARKET_FOTOCASA_USE_BRIGHTDATA, MARKET_IDEALISTA_ENABLED,\nWHATSAPP_TEMPLATE_MARKET_ALERT, MARKET_PRICING_SOURCE,\nMARKET_IMAGE_IMPORT_PORTALS — ver docs/market-worker-deploy.md y\ndocs/statefox-deprecation.md.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c9191b69304a64cc07e26ee63502e54d7371df6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/0c9191b69304a64cc07e26ee63502e54d7371df6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/22b67674ceacc43133ef9f0bbd2bc22a86901cb2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/22b67674ceacc43133ef9f0bbd2bc22a86901cb2","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKDIyYjY3Njc0Y2VhY2M0MzEzM2VmOWYwYmJkMmJjMjJhODY5MDFjYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/121b6b179ecc2c7e31540077dfbeab93a05f94c6","sha":"121b6b179ecc2c7e31540077dfbeab93a05f94c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/121b6b179ecc2c7e31540077dfbeab93a05f94c6"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/8120b95978a2ea475ee236454a1ed1729c72b836","sha":"8120b95978a2ea475ee236454a1ed1729c72b836","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/8120b95978a2ea475ee236454a1ed1729c72b836"}],"sha":"22b67674ceacc43133ef9f0bbd2bc22a86901cb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/22b67674ceacc43133ef9f0bbd2bc22a86901cb2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/8120b95978a2ea475ee236454a1ed1729c72b836/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:33:59Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:33:59Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"feat(M-market): adaptar UI oportunidades a clusters MarketProperty\n\nMigra la vista existente de oportunidades de captación de \"una fila por\nlisting\" a \"una fila por MarketProperty (cluster)\" con badges por\nportal, sin reescribir la página completa: mantenemos el grid, los\nfiltros y los handlers existentes y mappeamos PropertyClusterDTO al\nshape que la tabla ya entendía.\n\nCambios:\n- types.ts: añade PropertyClusterRow y normaliza el contrato compartido\n  con el backend de /api/market/properties/search.\n- mock.ts: fixtures con propiedades clusterizadas y propiedades\n  virtuales (un solo listing) para poder probar la vista sin tocar la\n  base de datos (?mock=1).\n- oportunidades-view.tsx: consume /api/market/properties/search,\n  pinta badges de portales, rango de precios y enlaza la fila a la\n  ficha /platform/market/properties/[id]. Mantiene compatibilidad con\n  el toolbar y los filtros existentes.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"65370bde34247345b0f0ad471383a30df7913986","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/65370bde34247345b0f0ad471383a30df7913986"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/8120b95978a2ea475ee236454a1ed1729c72b836","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/8120b95978a2ea475ee236454a1ed1729c72b836","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKDgxMjBiOTU5NzhhMmVhNDc1ZWUyMzY0NTRhMWVkMTcyOWM3MmI4MzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/f77d92f73b3267bbe619222a4704ecb78194971f","sha":"f77d92f73b3267bbe619222a4704ecb78194971f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/f77d92f73b3267bbe619222a4704ecb78194971f"}],"sha":"8120b95978a2ea475ee236454a1ed1729c72b836","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/8120b95978a2ea475ee236454a1ed1729c72b836"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/f77d92f73b3267bbe619222a4704ecb78194971f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:33:39Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:33:39Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"feat(M-market): reemplazar Statefox por MarketListing en pricing/microsite con feature flag\n\nMigración controlada del data source de pricing y microsites: pasamos\nde consumir la API externa Statefox a consumir nuestros propios datos\nnormalizados en MarketListing. Controlado por la feature flag\nMARKET_PRICING_SOURCE (statefox | market) con fallback al anterior si\nalgo falla, para deprecación gradual.\n\nServicios nuevos sobre MarketListing:\n- lib/market/comparables.ts: análogo a fetchPricingComparables() de\n  Statefox pero contra MarketListing. Incluye selectMarketListingImages\n  (sirve Cloudinary cuando ya está importado, portal directo cuando no)\n  y queueMarketImageImportsForListings (encola lazy import para\n  Idealista). Devuelve PricingComparable[] mantenendo el contrato.\n- lib/market/search.ts: análogo a snapshotSearch() para el flujo del\n  microsite (selección de propiedades por demanda) sobre MarketListing.\n  Misma estrategia híbrida de imágenes.\n\nAdaptación de los entry points:\n- lib/pricing/fetch-comparables.ts: lee MARKET_PRICING_SOURCE; si es\n  \"market\" usa lib/market/comparables, si no, mantiene Statefox.\n- lib/microsite/selection.ts: idem para la selección del microsite.\n- lib/statefox/client.ts, snapshot-search.ts, image-cache/select.ts:\n  ajustes mínimos para que la deprecación sea reversible (logs por la\n  flag, retorno consistente de imageCacheStatus).\n\nDocumentación:\n- docs/statefox-deprecation.md: estado del trabajo de deprecación,\n  feature flag, rollback plan y matriz de funcionalidades cubiertas.\n  Marca el image cache lazy como \"Listo (v1)\" tras este commit y el\n  anterior.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"973afaf144bb5ce63399c76d8362532ddb190a6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/973afaf144bb5ce63399c76d8362532ddb190a6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/f77d92f73b3267bbe619222a4704ecb78194971f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/f77d92f73b3267bbe619222a4704ecb78194971f","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKGY3N2Q5MmY3M2IzMjY3YmJlNjE5MjIyYTQ3MDRlY2I3ODE5NDk3MWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/ca19dc87b154b147ae2d340f74c42e2d71365746","sha":"ca19dc87b154b147ae2d340f74c42e2d71365746","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/ca19dc87b154b147ae2d340f74c42e2d71365746"}],"sha":"f77d92f73b3267bbe619222a4704ecb78194971f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/f77d92f73b3267bbe619222a4704ecb78194971f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/ca19dc87b154b147ae2d340f74c42e2d71365746/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:33:14Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:33:14Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"feat(M-market): image cache lazy con worker MARKET_IMPORT_LISTING_IMAGES\n\nResuelve el problema de URLs de imágenes caducables (especialmente\nIdealista, que devuelve 403 a las pocas horas) sin pagar el coste de\ncachear todo en Cloudinary por defecto. Política híbrida configurable\npor portal.\n\nPolítica de selección:\n- lib/market/image-import.ts: helper central. Por defecto se sirven las\n  URLs directas del portal (rápido, sin coste). Para los portales en\n  MARKET_IMAGE_IMPORT_PORTALS (default implícito: \"idealista\") se encola\n  un import lazy a Cloudinary y se sirve la versión importada cuando\n  esté disponible. selectMarketListingImages() devuelve fotos +\n  imageCacheStatus (IMPORTED / PENDING / undefined).\n- queueMarketImageImportsForListings(): upserts MarketListingImage con\n  status PENDING e idempotency key basada en el sha1 de las URLs para\n  evitar reencolar el mismo job.\n\nWorker MARKET_IMPORT_LISTING_IMAGES:\n- lib/market/jobs/import-listing-images-handler.ts: descarga cada\n  imagen desde el portal (vía downloadPortalImage), la sube a\n  Cloudinary con public_id estable (market/{portal}/{listingId}/{i})\n  y persiste resultado o error categorizado (FAILED retriable,\n  BLOCKED/CAPTCHA/LISTING_REMOVED no retriables).\n- Circuit breaker por portal (`market-image-import:{portal}`) que abre\n  ante fallos consecutivos para no martillear.\n- Idempotencia por (listingId, imageIndex) y por contenido (sha256 de\n  la imagen original) para no resubir la misma URL.\n\nRegistro:\n- lib/workers/consumer/types.ts: añade el tipo al canonical list.\n- lib/workers/consumer/job-handlers.ts: registra el handler.\n- lib/market/jobs/index.ts: exporta el handler.\n\nTests:\n- lib/market/__tests__/image-import.test.ts (5 tests):\n  selectMarketListingImages y shouldRequestMarketImageImport.\n- lib/market/__tests__/image-import-queue.test.ts: idempotencia y\n  filtrado por portal antes de encolar.\n- lib/market/jobs/__tests__/import-listing-images-handler.test.ts (3\n  tests): caso éxito, error retriable y propagación de status.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"e8295cc35833033b53e4e09e1f8e6867ca61b17e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/e8295cc35833033b53e4e09e1f8e6867ca61b17e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/ca19dc87b154b147ae2d340f74c42e2d71365746","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/ca19dc87b154b147ae2d340f74c42e2d71365746","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKGNhMTlkYzg3YjE1NGIxNDdhZTJkMzQwZjc0YzQyZTJkNzEzNjU3NDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/23458e1d9ec8e490e9a90ec2fc274f19a7bc92e2","sha":"23458e1d9ec8e490e9a90ec2fc274f19a7bc92e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/23458e1d9ec8e490e9a90ec2fc274f19a7bc92e2"}],"sha":"ca19dc87b154b147ae2d340f74c42e2d71365746","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/ca19dc87b154b147ae2d340f74c42e2d71365746"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/23458e1d9ec8e490e9a90ec2fc274f19a7bc92e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:32:47Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:32:47Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"feat(M-market): alertas guardadas con entrega in-app y WhatsApp\n\nConvierte el cron MARKET_RUN_RULES en un evaluador real de alertas que\nnotifica a los usuarios cuando aparecen listings que matchean sus\ncriterios. Reemplaza el run-rules placeholder por la implementación\nfuncional.\n\nComponentes:\n- lib/market/alerts.ts: dominio completo de alertas — CRUD, filtros\n  con polígono opcional (ray-casting via lib/market/geo), evaluación\n  de matches con dedup por listingId, envío por canal (in-app y/o\n  WhatsApp), métricas de entrega persistidas en MarketAlertDelivery.\n- POST/GET /api/market/alerts: crea/lista alertas del usuario\n  autenticado con validación zod (filtros y canales).\n- PATCH/DELETE /api/market/alerts/[id]: edita/borra/pausa, scoping\n  estricto por owner.\n- POST /api/market/alerts/[id]/test: dispara una evaluación en frío\n  para que el usuario valide sus criterios sin esperar al cron.\n- /platform/market/alerts: UI para gestionar alertas (lista, crear,\n  editar, pausar, ver historial de entregas).\n- app/api/cron/market/run-rules: ejecuta evaluador real para todas las\n  alertas activas, agrupa matches por usuario, entrega in-app via\n  Notification + Pusher, y envía WhatsApp template (configurable por\n  WHATSAPP_TEMPLATE_MARKET_ALERT, log+skip si no está definida).\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"7e0aac9623207a7fab865017920714ad3c3ec8dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/7e0aac9623207a7fab865017920714ad3c3ec8dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/23458e1d9ec8e490e9a90ec2fc274f19a7bc92e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/us