642e830846d297dd4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:32:26Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:32:26Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"feat(M-market): dashboard de mercado con KPIs y evolución\n\nVista analítica para el equipo: KPIs de inventario, evolución del\nprice-per-meter (€/m²), distribución por zonas y top advertisers.\n\nComponentes:\n- lib/market/dashboard.ts: agregaciones server-side con SQL/Prisma\n  (total activos, nuevos en últimas 24h/7d, mediana €/m² por housing\n  type/operation, evolución 30 días desde MarketSnapshotIndex,\n  distribución por zona, top 10 advertisers por nº de listings).\n- GET /api/market/dashboard: expone DashboardSnapshotDTO consumible\n  por el cliente.\n- /platform/market/dashboard: UI con cards de KPIs, gráfico de líneas\n  (recharts) para la evolución €/m² y tablas de zonas y advertisers.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"17bc3eac3d033b6b3436526ad004f4bb00e52840","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/17bc3eac3d033b6b3436526ad004f4bb00e52840"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/6517c7a886105d3eab2d880642e830846d297dd4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/6517c7a886105d3eab2d880642e830846d297dd4","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKDY1MTdjN2E4ODYxMDVkM2VhYjJkODgwNjQyZTgzMDg0NmQyOTdkZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/1aea9b726b603d54ae926ffeea32bce193442b3f","sha":"1aea9b726b603d54ae926ffeea32bce193442b3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/1aea9b726b603d54ae926ffeea32bce193442b3f"}],"sha":"6517c7a886105d3eab2d880642e830846d297dd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/6517c7a886105d3eab2d880642e830846d297dd4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/1aea9b726b603d54ae926ffeea32bce193442b3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:32:10Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:32:10Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"feat(M-market): ficha dedicada de propiedad y kanban de captación\n\nUI operativa para que el equipo trabaje sobre clusters MarketProperty\ncon todas las vistas necesarias para captación.\n\nFicha de propiedad (/platform/market/properties/[id]):\n- Galería de fotos agregadas de todos los listings del cluster.\n- Mapa de la zona con marcador (lng/lat aproximado).\n- Características normalizadas, listings por portal con precio y\n  estado, advertiser canónico y CTAs sticky para CRM.\n- Timeline cronológica con MarketEvent y cambios de stage.\n\nRedirect /platform/market/listings/[id]:\n- Pequeño handler que resuelve el propertyId del listing y redirige\n  a la ficha del cluster, evitando vistas huérfanas por listing.\n\nKanban de captación (/platform/market/captacion/kanban):\n- Drag & drop por MarketCaptacionStage (NUEVA, CONTACTANDO, EN_GESTIÓN,\n  GANADA, FALLIDA) con transiciones validadas y modal para registrar\n  captacionFailureReason cuando se mueve a FALLIDA.\n- Filtros por ciudad, advertiser type y operación.\n\nPOST /api/market/listings/[id]/captacion-stage:\n- Endpoint server-side que aplica la transición, valida el camino y\n  emite MARKET_LISTING_CAPTACION_STAGE_CHANGED para auditoría.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd9ce04b0efe00c787cba117b72e306d5cf97499","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/dd9ce04b0efe00c787cba117b72e306d5cf97499"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/1aea9b726b603d54ae926ffeea32bce193442b3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.git