s","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/0af10c0bea6ed8d73f0383f746a52d6daaaaee34/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:31:51Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:31:51Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"feat(M-market): cola de revisión de identidad cross-portal\n\nCierra el ciclo del handler MARKET_RESOLVE_IDENTITY: cuando el score de\nsimilitud cae en la franja [0.70, 0.90) emite MARKET_PROPERTY_REVIEW_REQUIRED\n(ya existente). Esta entrega añade la UI y la API para que un admin\nresuelva esos eventos manualmente con merge / split / ignore.\n\nComponentes:\n- lib/market/identity-review.ts: servicio que lista candidatos pendientes\n  (eventos sin resolvedAt) y aplica la resolución persistiendo\n  resolvedAt/resolvedBy/resolutionAction en MarketEvent. Para \"merge\"\n  reasigna propertyId del listing al cluster destino (creando uno si hace\n  falta) y actualiza fingerprintAttempts.\n- GET /api/market/identity/candidates: lista paginada con scoring del\n  evento, listing actual, candidatos sugeridos y diff de campos clave.\n- POST /api/market/identity/resolve: aplica la decisión del admin con\n  validación zod, devuelve el ResolveCandidateResult ({ ok, action,\n  resolvedPropertyId, listingId }).\n- /platform/market/identity/review: vista comparativa con tabla, panel\n  lateral con los listings candidato vs original, fotos, advertiser,\n  precio y botones de acción.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":