ts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/abf4ee7e59bdc84040c8a8c00b917029c824695c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:31:32Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:31:32Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"feat(M-market): backend de clusters de propiedades cross-portal\n\nPermite agrupar listings de distintos portales (idealista, fotocasa,\npisos.com, etc.) que representan la misma propiedad física en un único\nMarketProperty, exponiendo una API consumible por la UI de oportunidades\ny la ficha dedicada.\n\nComponentes:\n- lib/market/properties.ts: query y mapping a PropertyClusterDTO. Soporta\n  propiedades \"virtuales\" (un solo listing sin clúster aún) para que la\n  UI nunca esconda listings sin resolver, y agrega badges por portal,\n  rango de precios y price-per-meter.\n- GET /api/market/properties/search: paginado, filtros por ciudad,\n  operación, housing type, advertiser type, presencia de teléfono y\n  precio min/max. Devuelve PropertyClusterDTO para alimentar la nueva\n  vista de oportunidades agrupada por propiedad.\n- GET /api/market/properties/[id]: detalle completo del cluster con\n  todos los listings y su estado.\n- GET /api/market/properties/[id]/timeline: timeline cronológica con\n  eventos de MarketEvent + cambios de captacionStage de los listings,\n  para la sección de actividad en la ficha.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"49d0b3b98b0e9ac62137d7633d483e7dd1951cc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/49d0b3b98b0e9ac62137d7633d483e7dd1951cc7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/abf4ee7e59bdc84040c8a8c00b917029c824695c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/abf4ee7e59bdc84040c8a8c00b917029c824695c","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKGFiZjRlZTdlNTliZGM4NDA0MGM4YThjMDBiOTE3MDI5YzgyNDY5NWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/7f32723a913ab7aa335cf205391e6a3dd3318a6a","sha":"7f32723a913ab7aa335cf205391e6a3dd3318a6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/7f32723a913ab7aa335cf205391e6a3dd3318a6a"}],"sha":"abf4ee7e59bdc84040c8a8c00b917029c824695c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/abf4ee7e59bdc84040c8a8c00b917029c824695c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/7f32723a913ab7aa335cf205391e6a3dd3318a6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:31:14Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T12:31:14Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"feat(M-market): schema Prisma y migraciones para MVP Statefox in-house\n\nAporta los modelos y enums que sustentan los siguientes módulos del MVP\ndel Core Mercado (clusters, identidad, kanban, dashboard, alertas, image\ncache lazy y migración pricing/microsite). Todas las migraciones son\naditivas y no rompen lecturas/inserts previos.\n\nCambios de schema:\n- MarketEvent: añade `resolvedAt`, `resolvedBy`, `resolutionAction` para\n  cerrar el ciclo de revisión humana de MARKET_PROPERTY_REVIEW_REQUIRED\n  desde /platform/market/identity/review (auditoría: quién y cuándo).\n- MarketListing: añade `captacionFailureReason` para registrar el motivo\n  cuando una transición de stage en el kanban marca FALLO.\n- MarketSavedAlert + MarketAlertDelivery: alertas por demanda definidas\n  por cualquier usuario (filtros, canales in_app/whatsapp, frecuencia,\n  estado activo, métricas de entrega).\n- MarketListingImage: catálogo por listing con estado del import a\n  Cloudinary (PENDING/IMPORTING/IMPORTED/FAILED/BLOCKED/...) y URLs/hash\n  para garantizar idempotencia y evitar 403 por URLs caducables.\n- JobType: añade `MARKET_IMPORT_LISTING_IMAGES` para el worker lazy de\n  imágenes.\n\nMigraciones:\n- 20260513120000_add_market_event_resolution: ALTER TABLE aditivo +\n  índice parcial para listar pendientes sin escanear toda la tabla.\n- 20260513120500_add_market_captacion_failure_reason: ALTER TABLE.\n- 20260513121000_add_market_saved_alerts: CREATE TABLE para las dos\n  tablas nuevas + índices para listados por usuario y por alerta.\n- 20260513121500_add_market_listing_image: CREATE TABLE +\n  unique(listingId, imageIndex) para idempotencia + índices por status.\n- 20260513225000_add_market_import_listing_images_jobtype: ALTER TYPE\n  para añadir el valor al enum JobType (idempotente con WHEN\n  duplicate_object).\n\n.env.example:\n- MARKET_IMAGE_IMPORT_PORTALS: política CSV de portales que disparan el\n  import lazy a Cloudinary (default implícito en código: \"idealista\").\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"fac8f7a77a4b7c72ed54736f8a81f4b2dc7fb7d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/fac8f7a77a4b7c72ed54736f8a81f4b2dc7fb7d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/7f32723a913ab7aa335cf205391e6a3dd3318a6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsi