igración Prisma y tests asociados.\n- `docs/microsite-feedback-loop.md`: actualizado para reflejar que ya\n  existen dos canales (botón canónico para `ME_INTERESA` y NLU para\n  `NO_ME_ENCAJA` / variables). Se actualiza el diagrama del flujo,\n  el contrato NLU (sin `ME_ENCAJA`/`ME_INTERESA`), los eventos\n  emitidos, la sección de canales canónicos y se documentan las\n  variables de entorno de las dos plantillas nuevas.\n- `docs/guia-comerciales-microsite.md`: paso 6 de la guía aclara que el\n  feedback del comprador llega por dos vías (botón \"Me encaja\" del\n  portal + texto libre WhatsApp); se añade FAQ explicando cómo\n  funciona el botón y por qué el sistema redirige al botón cuando el\n  comprador escribe \"me encaja\" en WhatsApp.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"bfa6aafa716d248c77f6ae0fa3ba39ee12ae66cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/bfa6aafa716d248c77f6ae0fa3ba39ee12ae66cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/27710282ab672c20c43830b84b009ea49ffcbd6d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/27710282ab672c20c43830b84b009ea49ffcbd6d","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKDI3NzEwMjgyYWI2NzJjMjBjNDM4MzBiODRiMDA5ZWE0OWZmY2JkNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/6cf632eb8bfc1374eae22eeed307e5f805cf3b28","sha":"6cf632eb8bfc1374eae22eeed307e5f805cf3b28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/6cf632eb8bfc1374eae22eeed307e5f805cf3b28"}],"sha":"27710282ab672c20c43830b84b009ea49ffcbd6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/27710282ab672c20c43830b84b009ea49ffcbd6d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/6cf632eb8bfc1374eae22eeed307e5f805cf3b28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T00:52:59Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T00:52:59Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"test(M6): test E2E del flujo \"Me encaja\" + actualización del E2E existente\n\n- Nuevo `microsite-card-me-encaja-flow.test.ts`: cubre el canal canónico\n  end-to-end llamando directamente al handler de\n  `/api/seleccion/[token]/feedback`:\n  - Primer click registra `ME_INTERESA`, persiste\n    `MicrositeSelectionFeedback`, dispara\n    `notifyCommercialVisitInterest`, y encola exactamente UN\n    `SEND_BUYER_INTEREST_ACK` con `sourceEventId` correcto. El handler\n    drena la cola y verifica que `sendBuyerInterestAckToBuyer` se llama\n    con `buyerName` y `propertyTitle` correctos.\n  - Segundo click sobre la misma propiedad responde 409 y no genera\n    nuevos eventos ni jobs (idempotencia hard).\n  - Click sobre otra propiedad de la misma selección sí encola un\n    nuevo acuse independiente.\n\n- `microsite-flow-e2e.test.ts`: el escenario 4 se reescribe para\n  utilizar el canal `microsite_card` (emitiendo `SELECCION_COMPRADOR`\n  con `source.channel=\"microsite_card\"` y verificando que se encola\n  `SEND_BUYER_INTEREST_ACK`). El escenario 6 (`wantsMoreOptions`) ya\n  no usa `intention=\"ME_ENCAJA\"` — pasa a `OTRO`. Se añaden mocks de\n  `sendBuyerInterestAckToBuyer` y `notifyCommercialVisitInterest`.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"e8715cfb688f58d67584975f151ac548b003239c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/e8715cfb688f58d67584975f151ac548b003239c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/6cf632eb8bfc1374eae22eeed307e5f805cf3b28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/6cf632eb8bfc1374eae22eeed307e5f805cf3b28","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKDZjZjYzMmViOGJmYzEzNzRlYWUyMmVlZWQzMDdlNWY4MDVjZjNiMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/335f675cc88a1531ef464c76510dcaa449b1638e","sha":"335f675cc88a1531ef464c76510dcaa449b1638e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/335f675cc88a1531ef464c76510dcaa449b1638e"}],"sha":"6cf632eb8bfc1374eae22eeed307e5f805cf3b28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/6cf632eb8bfc1374eae22eeed307e5f805cf3b28"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/335f675cc88a1531ef464c76510dcaa449b1638e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T00:52:39Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T00:52:39Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"test(M6): alinear suite de evaluación NLU con el nuevo contrato\n\nLos escenarios de evaluación NLU expresaban interés positivo via\n`intention: \"ME_ENCAJA\"` y `sentiment: \"ME_INTERESA\"`. Tras el refactor\ndel flujo \"Me encaja\" esos valores ya no son válidos. Cambios:\n\n- `lib/eval/types.ts`: `ExpectedOutcome.propertyFeedback.sentiment` se\n  restringe a `\"NO_ME_ENCAJA\"` (con nota explicativa del cambio).\n- `lib/eval/conversational-mock-tools.ts`: las mock tools reflejan el\n  mismo contrato que las reales (`emit_selection_feedback.decision`\n  literal `\"NO_ME_ENCAJA\"`, enums actualizados a `OTRO`).\n- Escenarios actualizados: cuando el comprador expresa interés positivo\n  en texto libre el `expectedOutcome.intention` pasa a `\"OTRO\"` y\n  `propertyFeedback` queda vacío. Las `buyerInstructions` recuerdan al\n  modelo que el canal canónico es el botón del micrositio (ambiguity,\n  conversational, edge-cases, multi-turn, property-resolution,\n  sentiment-accuracy, wants-more).\n\nLos escenarios de rechazo (`NO_ME_ENCAJA`) y ajuste de variables se\nmantienen — sí son inferidos por NLU.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"87fcf663b6c6e2994e82df2b6101da2c26e42ae5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/87fcf663b6c6e2994e82df2b6101da2c26e42ae5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/335f675cc88a1531ef464c76510dcaa449b1638e","verificatio