14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/8850f3ec2a51fe7082a88bb1bc6ab728ce1deeb4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T00:52:03Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T00:52:03Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"feat(M6): botón \"Me encaja\" por ficha en el micrositio del comprador\n\nFrontend del canal canónico para registrar interés positivo. Mantiene\nSSR (los flags `alreadyInterested` se calculan en el server) para que\nel badge \"Ya elegida\" sea la verdad inicial y no haya parpadeos.\n\n- `components/seleccion/property-card.tsx`: Client Component que sustituye\n  al grid inline. Render visual idéntico al anterior + nueva sección con\n  botón \"Me encaja\". Optimistic UI: muestra spinner durante la petición,\n  conmuta a un badge no clickable \"Ya elegida — un agente te contactará\"\n  tras 200/409, y revierte a botón con error toast en caso de 5xx/red.\n- `components/seleccion/me-encaja-button.tsx`: botón reutilizable para la\n  página de detalle (mismo contrato y misma idempotencia).\n- `app/seleccion/[token]/page.tsx`: precarga el set\n  `alreadyInterestedIds` desde `MicrositeSelectionFeedback` (decision\n  `ME_INTERESA`) y lo pasa a cada `PropertyCard`.\n- `app/seleccion/[token]/propiedad/[propertyId]/page.tsx`: precarga el\n  flag `alreadyInterested` para la propiedad y monta `MeEncajaButton`\n  junto al precio.\n\nEl botón queda permanentemente bloqueado tras el primer click, incluso\ntras recargar la página o volver al micrositio mucho más tarde.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"6186b1d91e25675e90c27279374c6e10dd5f1e02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/6186b1d91e25675e90c27279374c6e10dd5f1e02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/8850f3ec2a51fe7082a88bb1bc6ab728ce1deeb4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/8850f3ec2a51fe7082a88bb1bc6ab728ce1deeb4","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKDg4NTBmM2VjMmE1MWZlNzA4MmE4OGJiMWJjNmFiNzI4Y2UxZGVlYjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/a0fa3fad1529121d87b177e9a008cec34bb14940","sha":"a0fa3fad1529121d87b177e9a008cec34bb14940","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/a0fa3fad1529121d87b177e9a008cec34bb14940"}],"sha":"8850f3ec2a51fe7082a88bb1bc6ab728ce1deeb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/8850f3ec2a51fe7082a88bb1bc6ab728ce1deeb4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/a0fa3fad1529121d87b177e9a008cec34bb14940/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T00:49:57Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T00:49:57Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"refactor(M6): eliminar ME_ENCAJA / ME_INTERESA del contrato NLU\n\nEl interés positivo del comprador deja de inferirse desde texto libre.\nA partir de ahora se captura **exclusivamente** por el botón \"Me encaja\"\ndel micrositio (canal canónico `microsite_card`). Cambios:\n\n- `IntentionWhatsApp` pasa a `\"NO_ME_ENCAJA\" | \"BUSCO_DIFERENTE\" | \"OTRO\"`\n  (sin `ME_ENCAJA`).\n- `PropertyFeedbackItem.sentiment` se restringe a `\"NO_ME_ENCAJA\"`.\n- Prompts del grafo LangGraph (contextual y simple) actualizados para\n  guiar al modelo: si el comprador expresa interés positivo en texto\n  libre, debe devolver `intention=OTRO` y describir en `reasoning` que\n  el handler debe redirigirle al botón. NUNCA emite `ME_ENCAJA` ni\n  `sentiment=ME_INTERESA`.\n- `conversational-tools.ts`: la tool `emit_selection_feedback` solo\n  acepta `decision=\"NO_ME_ENCAJA\"` (literal). `classify_feedback` y\n  `update_demand` describen el contrato actualizado. El prompt del\n  agente conversacional incluye una \"Regla cardinal\" explícita sobre\n  el flujo.\n- `buyer-digest.ts`: el resumen del comprador sólo cuenta propiedades\n  descartadas (las gustadas viven en `MicrositeSelectionFeedback`).\n\nMás detalle en docs/microsite-me-encaja-flow.md.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"6822bd952af25f249a4f3255efc29134f142a6e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/6822bd952af25f249a4f3255efc29134f142a6e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/a0fa3fad1529121d87b177e9a008cec34bb14940","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/a0fa3fad1529121d87b177e9a008cec34bb14940","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKGEwZmEzZmFkMTUyOTEyMWQ4N2IxNzdlOWEwMDhjZWMzNGJiMTQ5NDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/054cc95130209a8d102a58284d67a16002e0a8c4","sha":"054cc95130209a8d102a58284d67a16002e0a8c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/054cc95130209a8d102a58284d67a16002e0a8c4"}],"sha":"a0fa3fad1529121d87b177e9a008cec34bb14940","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/a0fa3fad1529121d87b177e9a008cec34bb14940"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/054cc95130209a8d102a58284d67a16002e0a8c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T00:49:36Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T00:49:36Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"feat(M6): canal canónico \"Me encaja\" en API + handler + acuse al comprador\n\nImplementa el flujo end-to-end del botón \"Me encaja\" del micrositio\ncomo canal canónico para el interés positivo del comprador:\n\n- `/api/seleccion/[token]/feedback` ahora responde HTTP 409 cuando se\n  intenta registrar `ME_INTERESA` por segunda vez sobre la misma\n  propiedad (idempotencia hard). Sube `source.channel=\"microsite_card\"`\n  al primer nivel del payload para que los handlers discriminen el\n  canal sin leer metadata.\n- `handleSeleccionComprador`: cuando `decision === \"ME_INTERESA\"` y\n  `source.channel === \"microsite_card\"`, encola un job\n  `SEND_BUYER_INTEREST_ACK` con `idempotencyKey` basado en el\n  `event.id`. Los demás canales (NLU, etc.) no disparan acuse.\n- Nuevo `buyer-interest-ack-handler.ts`: carga la selección, dedup\n  defensiva contra `WHATSAPP_ENVIADO` con `kind=buyer_interest_ack`\n  por `selectionId+propertyId`, y envía la plantilla\n  `microsite_propiedad_me_encaja` al comprador con el título curado de\n  la propiedad.\n- Registro del handler en `job-handlers.ts`.\n\nGarantiza \"un click = un acuse\" pese a reintentos o doble click.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"0afb017f91518e767ccd6e482c441a519983e797","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/0afb017f91518e767ccd6e482c441a519983e797"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/054cc95130209a8d102a58284d67a16002e0a8c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/054cc95130209a8d102a58284d67a16002e0a8c4","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKDA1NGNjOTUxMzAyMDlhOGQxMDJhNTgyODRkNjdhMTYwMDJlMGE4YzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/53d263332febe14f801f1365fb580994a4b9f740","sha":"53d263332febe14f801f1365fb580994a4b9f740","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/53d263332febe14f801f1365fb580994a4b9f740"}],"sha":"054cc95130209a8d102a58284d67a16002e0a8c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/054cc95130209a8d102a58284d67a16002e0a8c4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/53d263332febe14f801f1365fb580994a4b9f740/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T00:49:18Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T00:49:18Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"feat(M6): añadir scripts de plantillas Meta y migración SEND_BUYER_INTEREST_ACK\n\nSoporte base para el refactor del flujo \"Me encaja\" del micrositio:\n\n- Scripts dedicados para crear en Meta Business Manager las plantillas\n  `microsite_listo_comprador` (mensaje inicial al comprador con tono\n  informativo) y `microsite_propiedad_me_encaja` (acuse tras pulsar\n  \"Me encaja\" en una ficha).\n- Migración SQL idempotente que añade `SEND_BUYER_INTEREST_ACK` al\n  enum `JobType` (con guard para entornos donde ya exista).\n\nLa aprobación de Meta puede tardar horas, por eso este commit se\nintroduce primero para correr en paralelo al resto del refactor.\n\nDetalle del flujo: docs/microsite-me-encaja-flow.md\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"b50bf5fdca352c697f1ff9f2846ec60b66e50c31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/b50bf5fdca352c697f1ff9f2846ec60b66e50c31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/53d263332febe14f801f1365fb580994a4b9f740","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly