arred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/9dbbf30e3c2016728e63fa2d6ee64d88a7ad8f42","node_id":"C_kwDORPftcNoAKDlkYmJmMzBlM2MyMDE2NzI4ZTYzZmEyZDZlZTY0ZDg4YTdhZDhmNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14/urus/commit/6618b0a9b962bb8710b3eed9f2cfe925424d586b","sha":"6618b0a9b962bb8710b3eed9f2cfe925424d586b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/6618b0a9b962bb8710b3eed9f2cfe925424d586b"}],"sha":"9dbbf30e3c2016728e63fa2d6ee64d88a7ad8f42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/9dbbf30e3c2016728e63fa2d6ee64d88a7ad8f42"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masterly14","id":169551251,"login":"masterly14","node_id":"U_kgDOChslkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/6618b0a9b962bb8710b3eed9f2cfe925424d586b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T13:43:23Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T13:43:23Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"fix(M11): resolver datos conocidos antes de pedirlos al avanzar operación\n\nAl avanzar una operación el formulario pedía los datos del comprador y la\npropiedad aunque ya existieran en Inmovilla, porque advanceOperacion solo\nvalidaba `manualData` sin consultar las fuentes reales. Ahora se resuelven\nprimero el comprador (Inmovilla cliente vía buyerClientId o keycli de la\ndemanda), el vendedor para ARRAS (sellerClientId o keycli del inmueble) y\nla propiedad (Inmovilla REST + Neon) reutilizando los helpers de\nlib/contracts/extraction/shared. Solo se piden al comercial los campos\nque de verdad no se pueden deducir.\n\nCambios adicionales:\n- expandDottedKeys + deepMerge para que las claves planas del formulario\n  (\"buyer.fullName\") encajen con la estructura anidada que espera\n  validateStageRequirements, y los overrides manuales tengan efecto.\n- Añadir \"rcatastral\" a CADASTRAL_KEYS (es el nombre real del campo en\n  la API REST de Inmovilla según docs/documentacion-api-rest-inmovilla.md).\n- 23 tests nuevos cubriendo el resolver, la fusión y la validación E2E\n  para OFERTA_FIRME y ARRAS.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"02b6894fa4ba588be3d00b7d6d4e9e690d204d86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/02b6894fa4ba588be3d00b7d6d4e9e690d204d86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/6618b0a9b962bb8710b3eed9f2cfe925424d586b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/gists{/gist_id}","