ttps://api.github.com/users/masterly14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/commits/5ef2753e4505ca926ae78b858d23a436304024ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T13:36:50Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T13:36:50Z","email":"svaron066@gmail.com","name":"masterly14"},"message":"fix(M6): enviar microsite al comprador en caliente al validar selecci�n\n\nPOST /api/validar-seleccion/[validationToken] (APPROVE) ahora env�a el\nmicrosite al comprador de forma s�ncrona usando un helper compartido. La\nrespuesta incluye wamid o el error real para que la UI muestre estado\nverdadero, en vez de devolver OK ciegamente tras encolar un job.\n\nSi el env�o hot falla (red, 429 de Meta, 5xx), se cae autom�ticamente al\njob SEND_MICROSITE_TO_BUYER como red de seguridad para que el consumer\nreintente con backoff sin perder el env�o. La respuesta incluye\nqueued:true en ese caso.\n\n- Nuevo helper lib/microsite/send-microsite-buyer-hot.ts, idempotente por\n  evento WHATSAPP_ENVIADO con kind=microsite_link y payload.selectionId.\n- handleSendMicrositeToBuyer (consumer) ahora delega en el helper; sigue\n  procesando los jobs disparados por auto-validate.ts (scheduled) y por\n  el fallback del endpoint.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"a1cbb1da3e420ad8256dbd69d3c069985ee1b279","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/trees/a1cbb1da3e420ad8256dbd69d3c069985ee1b279"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masterly14/urus/git/commits/5ef2753e4505ca926ae78b858d23a436304024ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169551251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masterly14/events{/privacy}","followers