r":{"date":"2026-06-06T08:48:20Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"message":"fix: standardize author email to mulkymalikudhr@mail.com","tree":{"sha":"5407a41679bf74d3b32a1b2cb26aeaf0cb8958c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mulkymalikuldhrs/berlin-spa/git/trees/5407a41679bf74d3b32a1b2cb26aeaf0cb8958c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mulkymalikuldhrs/berlin-spa/git/commits/ffde9d8290a519fe0f652126bf4c01164c5e8ff8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mulkymalikuldhrs/berlin-spa/commit/ffde9d8290a519fe0f652126bf4c01164c5e8ff8","node_id":"C_kwDORPn43doAKGZmZGU5ZDgyOTBhNTE5ZmUwZjY1MjEyNmJmNGMwMTE2NGM1ZThmZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mulkymalikuldhrs/berlin-spa/commit/cd509d48c943f3e15e3d37bcc085ccc3a0086275","sha":"cd509d48c943f3e15e3d37bcc085ccc3a0086275","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mulkymalikuldhrs/berlin-spa/commits/cd509d48c943f3e15e3d37bcc085ccc3a0086275"}],"sha":"ffde9d8290a519fe0f652126bf4c01164c5e8ff8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mulkymalikuldhrs/berlin-spa/commits/ffde9d8290a519fe0f652126bf4c01164c5e8ff8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mulkymalikuldhrs/berlin-spa/commits/cd509d48c943f3e15e3d37bcc085ccc3a0086275/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T19:11:18Z","email":"agent-01@dhaher-corp.ai","name":"AGENT-01 (Swarm Worker)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T19:11:18Z","email":"agent-01@dhaher-corp.ai","name":"AGENT-01 (Swarm Worker)"},"message":"fix: security, bugs, code quality improvements from full audit\n\nSECURITY FIXES:\n- Removed dangerous API key injection from vite.config.ts (was injecting\n  GEMINI_API_KEY into client bundle via process.env)\n- Removed error.message leak from ErrorBoundary (was exposing internal\n  error details to users)\n- Added .gitignore (was completely missing - risk of committing secrets,\n  node_modules, build artifacts)\n- Upgraded service worker from cache-first to network-first for HTML\n  (prevents serving stale content) with proper offline fallback\n\nBUG FIXES:\n- Fixed XIcon in Footer (was rendering an X/close icon instead of the\n  actual X/Twitter logo)\n- Fixed FAQ accessibility: added missing id=''faq-question-'' that\n  aria-labelledby was referencing (was a broken a11y link)\n- Connected BookingModal to NotificationManager''s trackBooking() -\n  booking events are now tracked for reminder notifications\n- Fixed version mismatch: CHANGELOG said v1.0.0 but package.json was\n  v2.0.0 (aligned to v2.0.0)\n- Fixed version mismatch: SECURITY.md said supported 1.0.x but\n  package.json is 2.0.0 (aligned to 2.0.x)\n- Fixed CONTRIBUTING.md: dev server URL said localhost:5173 but\n  vite.config.ts sets port 3000\n- Fixed service worker: added manifest.json to STATIC_ASSETS cache list\n- Bumped service worker cache name to v2 to invalidate stale caches\n\nCODE QUALITY:\n- Enabled TypeScript strict mode with noUnusedLocals,\n  noUnusedParameters, noFallthroughCasesInSwitch\n- Removed unnecessary experimentalDecorators and\n  useDefineForClassFields from tsconfig.json (no decorators used)\n- Added @types/react and @types/react-dom to devDependencies\n- Added description, author, license fields to package.json\n- Added typecheck and lint scripts to package.json\n- Build script now runs type-check before bundling\n- Removed duplicate root ARCHITECTURE.md (kept docs/ARCHITECTURE.md)\n- Service worker now handles fetch failures gracefully with 503\n  response instead of crashing","tree":{"sha":"80c2562437b13c0c56e9a72daec324c80dc918a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mulkymalikuldhrs/berlin-spa/git/trees/80c2562437b13c0c56e9a72daec324c80dc918a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mulkymalikuldhrs/berlin-spa/git/commits/cd509d48c943f3e15e3d37bcc085ccc3a0086275","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}