hod, and missing reason diagnostics\n- Add dividend coverage and per-asset refresh APIs\n- Update Home Dividend Income Table with Dividend/Distribution filters and forecast visibility\n- Add Agent dividend status, edit, history, and update workflows\n- Make dividend forecast migration MySQL-safe after partial DDL execution\n\nWhy:\n- MyAsset needs dividend income tracking across US stocks, US ETFs, Korean stocks, Korean ETFs, and pension portfolios\n- Domestic ETF distributions may be missing from providers, so users need forecast/manual fallback and clear missing-data reasons\n- Tax handling should differ by portfolio profile instead of using one flat rate\n\nTest:\n- apps/api: python -m compileall app\n- apps/api: alembic upgrade head -> 048_dividend_forecast\n- apps/web-asset: npm run build","tree":{"sha":"48850c9d453e5813172eda8ef5da4073d01d8e76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/trees/48850c9d453e5813172eda8ef5da4073d01d8e76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/commits/905ddeb510fad1a511965e1299c2f85870ec3d11","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85814739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome","id":85814739,"login":"ChannyHome","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODE0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscrip