E0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/commits/36f1cc5e4f02d21e296ae4dcbc6b8ce9dd620f87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-12T03:06:27Z","email":"pigun412@gmail.com","name":"ck412.park"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-12T03:06:27Z","email":"pigun412@gmail.com","name":"ck412.park"},"message":"chore(ops): standardize Windows API scripts with titles, health checks, and status command\n\n본문:\n\nwhat:\nrun-api.ps1, restart-api.ps1, publish-local-stack-windows.ps1, publish-frontend-windows.ps1에 운영용 창 제목 통일 적용\nrun-api.ps1와 restart-api.ps1에 -LogToFile, -LogDir, -HealthTimeoutSeconds 옵션 추가\nAPI launcher state file에 port, health_url, stdout_log, stderr_log, worker_pid 기록 확장\nrestart 후 포트/health 확인을 포함한 health polling 추가\nstatus-api.cmd / deploy/scripts/status-api.ps1를 추가해 PID, 포트, health, 로그 경로를 한 번에 확인할 수 있도록 함\nPowerShell/CMD 종료 코드를 운영 친화적으로 정리\nwhy:\nWindows 로컬 운영에서 API 실행/재시작/상태 확인 흐름을 더 일관되고 추적 가능하게 만들고, 이후 Task Scheduler/NSSM/서비스화로 확장하기 쉬운 기반을 마련하기 위해\ntest:\nPowerShell parse check for:\nrun-api.ps1\ndeploy/scripts/restart-api.ps1\ndeploy/scripts/publish-local-stack-windows.ps1\ndeploy/scripts/publish-frontend-windows.ps1\ndeploy/scripts/status-api.ps1\npowershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\\\\deploy\\\\scripts\\\\status-api.ps1","tree":{"sha":"43fea2d0901689d9cea8de1a49096227f6688425","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/trees/43fea2d0901689d9cea8de1a49096227f6688425"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Channy