ject-limit을 더 명확히 표시하도록 개선\nChat 세션 정렬에서 MySQL 비호환 NULLS LAST를 제거하고 공통 정렬식으로 수정\nChat migration에서 users/households FK 타입을 기존 BigInteger 스키마와 맞추도록 수정\nHome Quick Insight v2 공통 패널, Snapshot 재사용, warning drill-down, mobile wrap 개선 반영\n로컬 운영용 frontend publish / API restart 스크립트 추가 및 문서화\nwhy:\nChat 기능의 기반 구조를 먼저 확보하고, 운영 설정/에러 가시성/DB 호환성/로컬 운영 편의성을 함께 정리하기 위해\ntest:\npy_compile for chat/openai/quick insight related backend files\nnpm --prefix apps/web-asset run build\nnpm --prefix apps/web-host run build\nAlembic upgrade through 042_chat_v1\n수동 확인: App Settings OpenAI test UI, Chat route/session load, Quick Insight render","tree":{"sha":"646308fd512e50a3b4c6d0d26a40ac01d75a08a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/trees/646308fd512e50a3b4c6d0d26a40ac01d75a08a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/commits/6c48529643e8d448be37cc9e7e435dd1701bedd0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85814739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome","id":85814739,"login":"ChannyHome","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODE0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://git