tack.cmd와 deploy/scripts/publish-local-stack-windows.ps1를 추가/개선해 frontend build, nginx reload, API restart를 한 번에 실행할 수 있도록 정리\ndeploy/scripts/restart-api.ps1와 restart-api.cmd를 추가해 API 재시작 전용 흐름 분리\nrun-api.ps1가 .runtime/api-launcher.json에 launcher PID를 기록하도록 변경해 이후 재시작 시 기존 API 창을 더 안정적으로 식별할 수 있게 보강\nlocal deploy/readme에 one-click publish, restart-api, browser cache refresh 가이드 추가\nwhy:\n로컬 운영 중 frontend 반영과 API 재기동을 더 빠르고 반복 가능하게 만들고, 기존 run-api.ps1을 유지한 채 상위 orchestration 흐름을 제공하기 위해\ntest:\npowershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\\\\deploy\\\\scripts\\\\publish-local-stack-windows.ps1 -SkipFrontend -SkipApiRestart\nPowerShell parser syntax check for:\ndeploy/scripts/restart-api.ps1\ndeploy/scripts/publish-local-stack-windows.ps1\nrun-api.ps1","tree":{"sha":"b0628e9502a80a14b99fe34bc542029e5fb9c509","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/trees/b0628e9502a80a14b99fe34bc542029e5fb9c509"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/commits/9c6412c99d9ebbb4281c36f429427388f31aec02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85814739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome","id":85814739,"login":"ChannyHome","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODE0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/