com","name":"ck412.park"},"message":"feat(deploy): add safe local stack publish and API restart scripts\n\n본문:\n\nwhat:\ndeploy/scripts/restart-api.ps1 추가\n기존 run-api.ps1 실행 창을 식별해 종료 시도\nAPI 포트 8000 점유 프로세스 정리\n새 PowerShell 창에서 run-api.ps1 재실행\nlauncher PID를 .runtime/api-launcher.json에 저장\nrestart-api.cmd 추가\n더블클릭/간편 실행용 Windows 래퍼\ndeploy/scripts/publish-local-stack-windows.ps1 개선\nfrontend publish 이후 restart-api.ps1을 호출하도록 변경\n완료 후 browser cache refresh 안내 추가\ndeploy/README.md에\npublish-local-stack.cmd\nrestart-api.cmd\n캐시 새로고침 가이드 문서화\nwhy:\n로컬 패치 후 frontend 반영, nginx reload, API 재시작을 더 안전하고 반복 가능하게 처리하고, 기존 run-api.ps1을 유지하면서 운영 편의성을 높이기 위해\ntest:\npowershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\\deploy\\scripts\\publish-local-stack-windows.ps1 -SkipFrontend -SkipApiRestart\nPowerShell parser syntax check for:\ndeploy/scripts/restart-api.ps1\ndeploy/scripts/publish-local-stack-windows.ps1","tree":{"sha":"63e7f84086e2832cfe10f0a182dc70db7ff422d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/trees/63e7f84086e2832cfe10f0a182dc70db7ff422d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/commits/3669596545de98098677207a574daf488bffd074","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85814739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome","id":85814739,"login":"ChannyHome","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODE0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/repos"