02:41Z","email":"pigun412@gmail.com","name":"ck412.park"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-21T11:02:41Z","email":"pigun412@gmail.com","name":"ck412.park"},"message":"feat(home+snapshot): ship Quick Insight v2 with shared panel, badges, and threshold help\n\n본문:\n\nwhat:\nHome Quick Insight를 공통 QuickInsightPanel.vue로 분리하고 Snapshot 페이지에도 재사용 연결\ndisplay_class 배지 추가로 CASH, LIABILITY, REAL ESTATE, CRYPTO, STOCK, DEPOSIT 등 원인 식별성 강화\nSummary Alert 문구를 snapshot delta 원인 중심으로 튜닝\nPortfolio Changes가 Net 체크 상태에 따라 Current Value Delta / Current Net Delta를 전환하도록 반영\nManual Quotes, Missing Quotes 상세 리스트 drill-down 추가\n모바일에서 긴 자산명/심볼/금액이 넘치지 않도록 wrap 기반 반응형 레이아웃 적용\nQuick Insight 헤더에 i 아이콘과 Minor move threshold 설명 팝오버 추가\nMinor move 문구를 변화량 포함 형태로 개선\nwhy:\nQuick Insight를 단순 수치 표시가 아니라 “왜 변했는지 설명하는” 분석 패널로 고도화하고, Home/Snapshot 모두 동일한 UX로 통일하기 위해\ntest:\n.\\apps\\api\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe -m py_compile apps/api/app/services/quick_insight.py apps/api/app/api/routers/snapshots.py apps/api/app/api/routers/analytics.py apps/api/app/schemas/analytics.py\nnpx vue-tsc -b in apps/web-asset\nnpm run build in apps/web-asset\n수동 확인: Home/Snapshot Quick Insight 렌더, 1D/7D/30D 전환, Net 체크, warning drill-down, 모바일 wrap, threshold info 팝오버","tree":{"sha":"71d0e1a2266998646eeaccb232fbf920f6dd5d44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/trees/71d0e1a2266998646eeaccb232fbf920f6dd5d44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/commits/8cb7567b1e92db3c29a6680000ebaf4e82317567","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85814739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome","id":85814739,"login":"ChannyHome","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODE0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome/MyAsset/commit/8cb7567b1e92db3c29a6680000ebaf4e82317567","node_id":"C_kwDORQCWa9oAKDhjYjc1NjdiMWU5MmRiM2MyOWE2NjgwMDAwZWJhZjRlODIzMTc1Njc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome/MyAsset/commit/8271886c745e5741a27d9e3f1d6ba4225ce07c7e","sha":"8271886c745e5741a27d9e3f1d6ba4225ce07c7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/commits/8271886c745e5741a27d9e3f1d6ba4225ce07c7e"}],"sha":"8cb7567b1e92db3c29a6680000ebaf4e82317567","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/commits/8cb7567b1e92db3c29a6680000ebaf4e82317567"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85814739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome","id":85814739,"login":"ChannyHome","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODE0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/commits/8271886c745e5741a27d9e3f1d6ba4225ce07c7e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-21T10:49:18Z","email":"pigun412@gmail.com","name":"ck412.park"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-21T10:49:18Z","email":"pigun412@gmail.com","name":"ck412.park"},"message":"feat(home+snapshot): add shared Quick Insight v2 panel with badges and snapshot reuse\n\n본문:\n\nwhat:\nHome Quick Insight를 공통 QuickInsightPanel.vue로 분리\nSnapshot 페이지에도 동일 Quick Insight 패널 추가\nQuick Insight에 display_class 배지 추가 (CASH, LIABILITY, REAL ESTATE, CRYPTO, STOCK, DEPOSIT 등)\nSummary Alert 문구를 snapshot delta 원인 중심으로 튜닝\nPortfolio Changes가 Net 체크 상태에 따라 Current Value Delta / Current Net Delta를 전환하도록 변경\nManual Quotes, Missing Quotes 상세 리스트와 모바일 반응형 wrap 레이아웃 추가\n모바일에서 긴 자산명/심볼/금액이 화면 밖으로 밀리지 않도록 줄바꿈 패턴으로 정리\nwhy:\nQuick Insight를 단순 수치 카드가 아니라 “변화 원인 설명” 패널로 고도화하고, Home/Snapshot 분석 UX를 같은 기준으로 통일하기 위해\ntest:\n.\\apps\\api\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe -m py_compile apps/api/app/services/quick_insight.py apps/api/app/api/routers/snapshots.py apps/api/app/api/routers/analytics.py apps/api/app/schemas/analytics.py\nnpx vue-tsc -b in apps/web-asset\nnpm run build in apps/web-asset\n수동 확인: Home/Snapshot Quick Insight 렌더, period toggle, Net toggle, warning drill-down, 모바일 wrap 동작","tree":{"sha":"2d865a36113a0e529b8dda30676253d1a94767fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/trees/2d865a36113a0e529b8dda30676253d1a94767fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/commits/8271886c745e5741a27d9e3f1d6ba4225ce07c7e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85814739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome","id":85814739,"login":"ChannyHome","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODE0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome/MyAsset/commit/8271886c745e5741a27d9e3f1d6ba4225ce07c7e","node_id":"C_kwDORQCWa9oAKDgyNzE4ODZjNzQ1ZTU3NDFhMjdkOWUzZjFkNmJhNDIyNWNlMDdjN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome/MyAsset/commit/5f27e9f7e34fa5ab53392a4d8bc5e93596b092b9","sha":"5f27e9f7e34fa5ab53392a4d8bc5e93596b092b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/commits/5f27e9f7e34fa5ab53392a4d8bc5e93596b092b9"}],"sha":"8271886c745e5741a27d9e3f1d6ba4225ce07c7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/commits/8271886c745e5741a27d9e3f1d6ba4225ce07c7e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85814739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome","id":85814739,"login":"ChannyHome","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODE0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/commits/5f27e9f7e34fa5ab53392a4d8bc5e93596b092b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-21T06:19:36Z","email":"pigun412@gmail.com","name":"ck412.park"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-21T06:19:36Z","email":"pigun412@gmail.com","name":"ck412.park"},"message":"feat(home): enhance Quick Insight interactions and warning drill-down\n\n본문:\n\nwhat:\nHome Quick Insight 카드에 Expand/Collapse 추가\nQuick Insight 접힘 상태를 localStorage에 저장/복원\nHome 카드 섹션 상태 저장 로직을 확장해 Live Dashboard, Report Panel, Quick Insight, Release Notes까지 함께 복원되도록 정리\nTop Gross Drivers와 Top Net Drivers를 하나의 카드로 통합하고 Net 체크박스로 전환 가능하게 변경\nNet 체크 상태를 localStorage에 저장/복원\nQuick Insight 헤더 레이아웃 정리 및 Expand/Collapse 버튼 hover 스타일을 다른 카드와 통일\nWarnings에 Manual Quotes, Missing Quotes 상세 리스트 응답/UI 추가\nManual Quotes, Missing Quotes를 기본 접힘형으로 두고 자산 목록 drill-down 가능하게 확장\nwhy:\nQuick Insight를 실제 운영/진단용 카드로 개선하고, 새로고침 후에도 사용자의 UI 상태와 분석 맥락이 유지되도록 하기 위해\ntest:\nnpm --prefix apps/web-asset run build\npy_compile for apps/api/app/schemas/analytics.py\npy_compile for apps/api/app/services/quick_insight.py","tree":{"sha":"abfe3a2895d67ee1e51c910592df09dbcfd0d2c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/trees/abfe3a2895d67ee1e51c910592df09dbcfd0d2c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/commits/5f27e9f7e34fa5ab53392a4d8bc5e93596b092b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.