_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODE0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/commits/a996cc85a0da9dd3d4e4fd68e5e21dd4837f4dac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T13:08:54Z","email":"pigun412@gmail.com","name":"ck412.park"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T13:08:54Z","email":"pigun412@gmail.com","name":"ck412.park"},"message":"feat(home+trade): add Home card drag-order persistence and fix Auto Cash Balance Set datetime handling\n\n본문:\n\nwhat:\napps/web-asset/src/pages/HomePage.vue에 Home 카드 드래그 정렬( Live Dashboard / Portfolios / Holdings / Liabilities / Report / Quick Insight / Release Notes ) 추가\n카드 순서를 localStorage(myasset:home:card-order)에 저장/복원\napps/api/app/api/routers/trades.py에서 model_dump(mode=\"python\")로 변경해 datetime 타입 유지\napps/api/app/services/trade_ledger.py에서 executed_at 문자열(ISO, Z 포함) 파싱 + UTC naive 정규화 추가\nwhy:\nHome 화면 커스터마이징(카드 순서 고정) 지원\nSet Actions의 Auto Cash Balance Set에서 간헐 Failed to create trade(datetime 직렬화/파싱 이슈) 해소\ntest:\nnpm --prefix apps/web-asset run build 통과\n.\\apps\\api\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe -m py_compile apps\\api\\app\\api\\routers\\trades.py apps\\api\\app\\services\\trade_ledger.py 통과\n수동 확인: Home 카드 드래그 후 새로고침 시 순서 유지, Auto Cash Balance Set 실행 성공","tree":{"sha":"fadf7ee075d75bc508537f0ed01df17ad52234be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/trees/fadf7ee075d75bc508537f0ed01df17ad52234be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/commits/a996cc85a0da9dd3d4e4fd68e5e21dd4837f4dac","ve