.github.com/users/ChannyHome/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome","id":85814739,"login":"ChannyHome","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODE0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/commits/749914d4e1fac5e635d64e5d9eaab2a62fe4f248/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T12:36:52Z","email":"pigun412@gmail.com","name":"ck412.park"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T12:36:52Z","email":"pigun412@gmail.com","name":"ck412.park"},"message":"feat(trade-ui): unify auto cash set with BALANCE_SET and auto-sync target by currency\n\n본문:\nwhat:\n\nTrade Set Actions의 Auto Cash Balance Set를 Manual Trade Entry(BALANCE_SET) 기준 UX로 정리.\nCurrency를 자유입력에서 콤보박스로 변경(KRW/USD 포함 지원 통화 목록).\nPortfolio 또는 Currency 변경 시 Target Balance를 해당 포트폴리오/통화의 현재 Auto Cash 잔액으로 자동 채움.\nUse Current, Auto Fill + Apply 옵션 제거로 입력 흐름 단순화.\n기존 카드 순서 드래그 저장(Set/Transfer/Entry localStorage) 기능 유지.\nwhy:\n\n동일 기능(BALANCE_SET)인데 화면별 동작이 달라 혼란이 있었음.\n통화 오입력 방지 및 멀티통화 포트폴리오(예: KRW/USD 동시 보유) 정확도 개선.\n불필요 옵션 제거로 운영자가 더 빠르고 안정적으로 Set 실행 가능.\ntest:\n\nnpm --prefix apps/web-asset run build 통과.\nTrade > Set Actions > Auto Cash Balance Set에서\nPortfolio 선택 시 Target 자동 채움 확인\nCurrency(KRW/USD) 변경 시 통화별 Target 자동 갱신 확인\nApply 후 Trade Journal에 BALANCE_SET 생성 및 값 반영 확인.","tree":{"sha":"7c218f6ac3631d5fefef1a457af22bf69d42a815","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/trees/7c218f6ac3631d5fefef1a457af22bf69d42a815"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset