/commits/a131c549b3b46e8b9d8a1bf222642aae541e97cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T00:43:24Z","email":"pigun412@gmail.com","name":"ck412.park"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T00:43:24Z","email":"pigun412@gmail.com","name":"ck412.park"},"message":"feat(trade): extend Set Actions with execution logs and Auto Cash Balance quick set\n\nwhat:\n- Added per-tab Set Actions recent logs (Portfolio/Holding/Liability/Cash), max 2 lines\n- Persisted Set Actions logs in localStorage and added per-tab Clear button\n- Added processing time (ms) to Set Actions success/error log lines\n- Added \"Auto Cash Balance Set\" tab in Rebaseline-Based Set Actions (uses existing BALANCE_SET trade)\n- Added \"Use Current\" button to auto-fill target balance from current auto-cash amount by portfolio+currency\n- Added \"Auto Fill + Apply\" option (default OFF): Use Current can immediately trigger Apply\n\nwhy:\n- Improve operator visibility, reduce input mistakes, and speed up cash-balance correction flow\n- Keep existing Manual Trade Entry BALANCE_SET unchanged while adding a faster Set Actions path\n\ntest:\n- npx vue-tsc -b (apps/web-asset) passed\n- Verified tab logs append on success/error, persist after refresh, and clear works\n- Verified Auto Cash Balance Set creates BALANCE_SET trade and refreshes reference/journal\n- Verified Use Current fills target correctly and Auto Fill + Apply runs submit flow when enabled","tree":{"sha":"e37790e140cbd4578dcfe023967321f60f5760e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/trees/e37790e140cbd4578dcfe023967321f60f5760e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/commits/a131c549b3b46e8b9d8a1bf222642aae541e97cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85814739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/events{/privacy}","followers_url"