/api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/commits/059e75c3873425f907c5d909a53f87cb0a243897/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-14T14:16:18Z","email":"pigun412@gmail.com","name":"ck412.park"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-14T14:16:18Z","email":"pigun412@gmail.com","name":"ck412.park"},"message":"feat(web-home+snapshot): add quote run status on Home and persist snapshot last action metadata\n\nwhat:\n\nAdded Update Quotes Now action to Home Live Dashboard Panel > Actions.\nAdded role gating (ADMIN/MAINTAINER only), async job polling, running progress (processed/total), disable during run, auto refresh on completion, and toast feedback.\nAdded “last quote run” metadata on Home (time/status/summary) with localStorage persistence.\nAdded Snapshot “last action” metadata (time/status/summary) with localStorage persistence.\nHooked Snapshot metadata updates to major actions:\ntake snapshot, apply snapshot, apply CSV preview, back to live, export CSV, delete snapshots, export dashboard PNG.\nUpdated NetworthTrend behavior to allow all metric checkboxes off and show empty-state message while keeping controls visible.\n\nwhy:\n\nImprove operational visibility and usability in Home for quote-trigger workflows.\nKeep users informed of most recent execution result without checking logs.\nProvide consistent action feedback across Snapshot workflows.\nAlign trend empty-state UX with user’s intended behavior.\n\ntest:\n\nBuilt frontend successfully:\nnpm --prefix apps/web-asset run build\nVerified Home:\nUpdate Quotes Now visible only for maintainer/admin.\nRunning state shows progress and blocks re-click.\nCompletion/failure updates status badge + last run label.\nHome data auto refreshes on completion.\nVerified Snapshot:\nLast action label updates for each supported action.\nLast action persists after page reload.\nVerified NetworthTrend:\nAll Gross/Liabilities/Net unchecked state shows Not enough points. with controls still visible.","tree":{"sha":"55755a0911baff1677a44a55373c4b587f8f6d04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/trees/55755a0911baff1677a44a55373c4b587f8f6d04"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/commits/059e75c3873425f907c5d909a53f87cb0a243897","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85814739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome","id":85814739,"login":"ChannyHome","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODE0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome/MyAsset/commit/059e75c3873425f907c5d909a53f87cb0a243897","node_id":"C_kwDORQCWa9oAKDA1OWU3NWMzODczNDI1ZjkwN2M1ZDkwOWE1M2Y4N2NiMGEyNDM4OTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome/MyAsset/commit/9dfe8438f77403facfb7f73