PSHOT 데이터 소스 혼동 방지\n- 캡처 성공 토스트가 다른 컨텍스트로 이동 후 남아 있는 UX 문제 해결\n\ntest:\n- npm --prefix apps/web-asset run build 통과\n- Take Snapshot 후 메시지 노출 확인\n- Load Snapshot / Back to Live / Refresh 시 캡처 메시지 자동 제거 확인\n- Summary/Portfolio Return 전환 시 Y축 안내 문구가 동적으로 변경되는지 확인\n\n--\n\nfix(api): prepend UTF-8 BOM in snapshot csv export for Excel compatibility\n\nwhat:\n- /api/v1/snapshots/{snapshot_id}/export.csv 응답 본문 앞에 UTF-8 BOM(\\ufeff) 추가\n\nwhy:\n- Windows Excel에서 UTF-8 CSV 한글(포트폴리오명/자산명) 깨짐 현상 방지\n\ntest:\n- Snapshot CSV 재다운로드 후 Excel에서 한글 컬럼 정상 표시 확인\n- CSV preview(import) 경로 영향 없음 확인","tree":{"sha":"0a80b9fdf863a6fc72700921de34c1faa25bfd85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/trees/0a80b9fdf863a6fc72700921de34c1faa25bfd85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/commits/a46fd8b8453718cdca3297ecdde94cfaa6b69b25","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85814739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome","id":85814739,"login":"ChannyHome","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODE0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome/MyAsset/commit/a46fd8b84