ging service\n- add rebaseline services for holding/portfolio/liability\n- add admin entity history APIs (list/revert)\n- extend holding/portfolio/liability patch with edit_mode=SAFE|HARD\n- add Agent UI mode toggle (Rebaseline default), effective_at/reason, History/Revert drawer\n- update README with step + test checklist\n\nwhy:\n- prevent “edited value gets overwritten unexpectedly” confusion\n- keep ledger consistency while still allowing emergency hard override\n- provide audit/revert path for safe recovery\n\ntest:\n- npm --prefix apps/web-asset run build\n- (apps/api) .\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe -m compileall app\n- manual flow: SAFE rebaseline, HARD edit permission, entity history revert","tree":{"sha":"eb295a809076032a6f5247f9ae46bd93e83b4c38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/trees/eb295a809076032a6f5247f9ae46bd93e83b4c38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/commits/8dbbdf310d752398d148caa40d3af9bdf1d279c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85814739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome","id":85814739,"login":"ChannyHome","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODE0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://ap