o manual quote, trade fee auto-entry, and top bar layout fix\nwhat:\n- Agent Manual Quote: price validation을 0 허용으로 변경(ge=0), 숫자/통화 검증 강화, 자산 선택 시 통화 자동 반영\n- Trade: BUY/SELL 폼에 fee_amount 추가, fee>0이면 FEE 거래 자동 1건 추가 생성\n- Trade: 메인/FEE 생성 중 오류 시 void rollback 처리\n- Host TopBar: 메뉴 버튼 복구, 제목 중앙 정렬, Seoul 시각을 KRW/USD 옆으로 이동, 상단 테마 버튼 제거\n\nwhy:\n- 상장폐지/파산 등 0원 수동시세 입력 지원 필요\n- 매수/매도 수수료 기록 자동화로 사용자 입력 실수 감소\n- 모바일/데스크탑 상단 UI 회귀 및 가독성 이슈 해결\n\ntest:\n- Manual Quote에서 0 입력/적용 확인\n- BUY/SELL에서 fee=50 입력 시 거래 2건(BUY(or SELL)+FEE), fee 미입력/0 시 1건 확인\n- Top bar에서 LNB 열기 버튼/중앙 제목/Seoul 시각 표시 확인\n- web-host, web-asset 타입체크 통과","tree":{"sha":"c2130523107bf8fa4daa0099595af3c90260bfc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/trees/c2130523107bf8fa4daa0099595af3c90260bfc4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/commits/a4d188f1ec27b2e1de87000c7b192a37047b93a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85814739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome","id":85814739,"login":"ChannyHome","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODE0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://gith