s/ChannyHome/MyAsset/commits/1fce55fdb0f5bc10c78eea648ee4fbe72bd609af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-19T14:30:34Z","email":"pigun412@gmail.com","name":"ck412.park"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-19T14:30:34Z","email":"pigun412@gmail.com","name":"ck412.park"},"message":"feat(kpi): unify KPI/accounting terms across UI/API and finalize principal_net server sort\n\nwhat:\n- Added API alias fields for commercial terms:\n  - debt_adjusted_principal_total (alias of principal_minus_debt_total)\n  - net_contribution_total\n  - portfolio_profit_total (alias of total_pnl_amount)\n  - avg_cost / cost_basis_total aliases for holdings\n- Extended backend schemas/routers and frontend API types to expose/use aliases.\n- Completed server-side sort handling for portfolio principal:\n  - principal_net\n  - net_contribution_total\n- Unified UI wording in Home/Report/Dashboard/Agent/Trade:\n  - Debt-Adjusted Principal, Net Contribution, Portfolio Profit, Avg Cost, Cost Basis, Profit %\n- Documented accounting/KPI rules and alias compatibility in README.\n- Added release-note seed migration for this change set.\n\nwhy:\n- Remove terminology ambiguity between “principal - debt” vs “principal(net)”.\n- Standardize KPI language for commercial readiness and reduce user confusion.\n- Keep backward compatibility while moving to clearer names.\n- Ensure sortable portfolio principal metrics are consistent and reliable.\n\ntest:\n- npm --prefix apps/web-asset run build\n- python -m compileall app (apps/api)\n- Manual checks:\n  - Home/Report/Dashboard/Agent/Trade wording consistency\n  - Portfolio table server sort for principal_net / net_contribution_total\n  - KPI cards fallback to alias fields","tree":{"sha":"05103a4d7bbf62ac71fd06363bb95558be8b1b77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/trees/05103a4d7bbf62ac71fd06363bb95558be8b1b77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/commits/1fce55fdb0f5bc10c78eea648ee4fbe72bd609af