/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome","id":85814739,"login":"ChannyHome","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODE0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/commits/c232af4e74414e23a080a3d2f35f08da92d08c65/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-18T12:31:29Z","email":"pigun412@gmail.com","name":"ck412.park"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-18T12:31:29Z","email":"pigun412@gmail.com","name":"ck412.park"},"message":"[front,back] KRW/USD 전역 토글 + 사용자 설정 DB 저장 + Home/Report/Dashboard/Agent 반영\n--- 추가\ngit add apps/web-asset/src/pages/HomePage.vue apps/web-asset/src/data/releaseNotes.ts apps/web-asset/src/pages/AgentPage.vue\ngit commit -m \"feat(home): add release notes card at page bottom\" -m \"- add releaseNotes data source (date/time/title/summary)\n- render Release Notes card in Home\n- fix AgentPage unused symbol to keep web build green\"\n---\n사용자 통화 설정 API 추가\nGET /api/v1/users/me/settings\nPATCH /api/v1/users/me/settings\n파일:\nuser_settings.py\nuser_setting.py\nuser_settings.py\nmain.py\n__init__.py\n프론트 전역 통화 상태(composable) 추가\nDB 우선 로드 + localStorage 캐시 + 저장(PATCH)\n파일:\nuseDisplayCurrency.ts\nuserSettings.ts\n통화 토글 UI 컴포넌트 추가\n파일:\nDisplayCurrencyToggle.vue\n화면 반영\nHome, Report, Dashboard, Agent에 토글 추가\n해당 API 호출에 display_currency 전달\n파일:\nHomePage.vue\nReportPage.vue\nDashboardPage.vue\nAgentPage.vue\n검증 결과\n\nBackend import OK\nnpm --prefix apps/web-asset run build 성공\nnpm --prefix apps/web-host run build 성공\n테스트 방법\n\nAPI 서버 재시작 후 Swagger에서:\nGET /api/v1/users/me/settings\nPATCH /api/v1/users/me/settings body:\n{ \"display_currency\": \"USD\" }\n웹에서 Home/Report/Dashboard/Agent 들어가서 토글 전환\n값이 KRW/USD로 재조회되는지 확인\n새로고침 후 마지막 통화가 유지되는지 확인\n원하면 다음 단계로 바로 History(DB 감사로그 + LNB History 화면) 진행하겠습니다.\nstale 기능 추가","tree":{"sha":"579c7536a28dbfb929e8a082721c08caee799893","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/trees/579c7536a28dbfb929e8a082721c08caee799893"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChannyHome/MyAsset/git/commits/c232af4e74414e23a080a3d2f35f08da92d08c65","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85814739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome","id":85814739,"login":"ChannyHome","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODE0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChannyHome","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ChannyHome/MyAsset/commit/c232af4e74414e23a080a3d2f35f08da92d08c65","node_id":"C_kwDORQCWa9oAKGMyMzJhZjRlNzQ0MTRlMjNhMD