/api.github.com/users/nexus49/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nexus49","id":52737,"login":"nexus49","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/contrib-generic-resource-ui/commits/b657b905544f4f9c4eed0187bb03c326a5ade405/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-12T14:39:58Z","email":"bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com","name":"Bastian Echterhölter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-12T14:39:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: replace form/YAML dual-mode editor with YAML-only Monaco editor (#31)\n\nRemove the form-based resource editor and the Form/YAML mode toggle,\nreplacing them with a YAML-only Monaco editor for both the create-edit\nmodal and the standalone create-resource page. This simplifies the\nediting experience and avoids form/YAML synchronization issues.\n\nAlso fix namespace-aware resource deletion by propagating\nresourceNamespace through the UI state, actions, and effects so that\nnamespaced resources are properly deleted with the correct context.\n\n\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa244d38852160029c8b9deda151a9e14815ba91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/contrib-generic-resource-ui/git/trees/fa244d38852160029c8b9deda151a9e14815ba91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/contrib-generic-resource-ui/git/commits/b657b905544f4f9c4eed0187bb03c326a5ade405","verification":{"payload":"tree fa244d38852160029c8b9deda151a9e14815ba91\nparent 2ecfc57c31f59388dbaa65bd834bd569533dd6a9\nauthor Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com> 1773326398 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773326398 +0100\n\nfeat: replace form/YAML dual-mode editor with YAML-only Monaco editor (#31)\n\nRemove the form-based resource editor and the Form/YAML mode toggle,\nreplacing them with a YAML-only Monaco editor for both the create-edit\nmodal and the standalone create-resource page. This simplifies the\nediting experience and avoids form/YAML synchronization issues.\n\nAlso fix namespace-aware resource deletion by propagating\nresourceNamespace through the UI state, actions, and effects so that\nnamespaced resources are properly deleted with the correct context.\n\n\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpstA+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1+MQAIN3Uvyn0EbDZU3ufhG5yR7G\nsgZWo8NR36gndkvEVZwLoAMFNHUDu8+/Q3s2q3eXGMl9gTTT6h5gMhDxnbF9DbXx\nuOOl2pUAy9mURvxxhXYuT5UxnDswyFiEyQmBNK/QoBictbSMgMiJRz+OSnoRy0vC\nVYuJANQeeQWjL6LkKEj1FMkHmf/V+EltE6DC6nO0VffpQ/zt0+0AvLYgQSnM3MLg\nIKlKqm2Zq25YXEVi6SCd0j3Npw3FqDn+BXsZc5fhpuwgJjxzo26JUSRnxKtbWmr6\nk0NbsuNKro5U9Unzqvdplb3VevatRBleNSsVJvT+y4Eue4X4X/B87VhVzjgi4FmJ\nD1f3rTeJWMCn14qWPBJz2CvR3gT7abEebAkUODNj6H/oocwomR1zAKgT07ntv4X8\nLJpgPuMVZezDS+v47ahBwlwj9NyXZ+b7qpraKwtKJKPPBw6VtxM1Z0G9P4twnsDj\nN8pXJoRdVkV06DlItkDh2+JYZRyY2augOgGfg375BA6IFhlg5YIU01QXkL52cV6c\nsayJO+LtIcNSl2G5vcBfHVSRlLLcJBIS/xWe2//WCP/KawR2G0SMnmzQlX12SvOm\nX+vuClgMWfJiFxjDiHfX2JI/S2LlGC24/7Jy7AT2w9OMJ2bw/pUtEt4/zvAknKve\nCT+UFS4S/jKiCD7O7068\n=aogS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-12T14:39:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","