ceived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/contrib-generic-resource-ui/commits/e24524f0e5bc03de5b999e22680432f3e17dbfbd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-10T19:32:43Z","email":"bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com","name":"Bastian Echterhölter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T19:32:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: wait for namespace before watching namespaced resource in detail view (#11)\n\nThe detail view dispatched loadResourceDetail before the namespace was\navailable in the store, causing the GraphQL watch query to omit the\nrequired namespace argument for namespaced resources.\n\nAdd selectNamespaceId to the combineLatest and gate emission on namespace\npresence when the resource definition scope is Namespaced.\n\n\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>\n\nSigned-off-by: Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com>","tree":{"sha":"9dc1590f10d52e977ee7ecd70984ecb7e764971b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/contrib-generic-resource-ui/git/trees/9dc1590f10d52e977ee7ecd70984ecb7e764971b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/contrib-generic-resource-ui/git/commits/e24524f0e5bc03de5b999e22680432f3e17dbfbd","verification":{"payload":"tree 9dc1590f10d52e977ee7ecd70984ecb7e764971b\nparent 8ac8dcd9597d7120a0240de24c11ed83dad694b0\nauthor Bastian Echterhölter <bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com> 1773171163 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773171163 +0100\n\nfix: wait for namespace before watching namespaced resource in detail view (#11)\n\nThe detail view dispatched loadResourceDetail before the namespace was\navailable 