ulti-item types (sticky notes, text boxes, shapes)\n- Better item highlighting and shadows on active selection\n- Improved drag and drop with zoom-aware positioning\n- Live collaboration status indicator\n- Better mobile responsive toolbar\n- Contextual delete buttons on selected items\n- Item counter and live status display\n\nUI/UX:\n- Modern gradient backgrounds for notes\n- Smooth transitions and hover effects\n- Floating delete confirmation on selected items\n- Toggle-able toolbar\n- Cursor changes based on active tool\n- Better visual feedback during interactions\n- Cleaner board cards with hover actions","tree":{"sha":"ed6f04c6b701ace06a811799c43cc0e977d54a91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kellyworkos00-droid/NEXORA/git/trees/ed6f04c6b701ace06a811799c43cc0e977d54a91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kellyworkos00-droid/NEXORA/git/commits/7c0b56c8698840aecb3313751dc186de89640d18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/240471982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kellyworkos00-droid","id":240471982,"login":"kellyworkos00-droid","node_id":"U_kgDODlVPrg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/subscriptions","type":"Use