","node_id":"U_kgDODlVPrg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kellyworkos00-droid/NEXORA/commits/9ce35b642740c9d895623787f21a784b020fc1ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-14T13:59:22Z","email":"kellyworkos00@gmail.com","name":"kellyworkos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-14T13:59:22Z","email":"kellyworkos00@gmail.com","name":"kellyworkos"},"message":"feat: Add complete user management system with admin panel\n\nMajor Features Added:\n- User profile management (name, bio, avatar, preferences)\n- Activity logging and audit trail system\n- Admin panel with user management and analytics\n- Session management (view/terminate devices)\n- User preferences (theme, language, timezone, notifications)\n- Account deletion with confirmation\n- Password change functionality\n- Comprehensive statistics and analytics\n\nDatabase Updates:\n- Enhanced users table (avatar_url, bio, role, last_login_at)\n- Enhanced sessions table (device tracking, IP, user agent)\n- New user_preferences table\n- New activity_logs table with JSONB metadata\n- Optimized indexes for performance\n\nAPI Endpoints (13 new):\nUser Management:\n- GET /api/user/profile - Get user profile\n- PATCH /api/user/profile - Update profile\n- POST /api/user/change-password - Change password\n- GET /api/user/preferences - Get preferences\n- PATCH /api/user/preferences - Update preferences\n- GET /api/user/stats - Get user statistics\n- GET /api/user/activity - Get activity logs\n- GET /api/user/sessions - List active sessions\n- DELETE /api/user/sessions - Terminate sessions\n- POST /api/user/delete-account - Delete account\n\nAdmin Panel:\n- GET /api/admin/users - List all users (paginated)\n- PATCH /api/admin/users/:id - Update user role\n- DELETE /api/admin/users/:id - Delete user\n- GET /api/admin/stats - Admin dashboard statistics\n\nUtilities:\n- Activity logger with 20+ tracked actions\n- User preferences management\n- Enhanced error handling\n- Activity metadata in JSONB\n\nAll features fully tested and TypeScript error-free!","tree":{"sha":"b464bb72ac4e9028afd8e5e864550f3684cab783","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kellyworkos00-droid/NEXORA/git/trees/b464bb72ac4e9028afd8e5e864550f3684cab783"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kellyworkos00-droid/NEXORA/git/commits/9ce35b642740c9d895623787f21a784b020fc1ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/240471982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kellyworkos00-droid","id":240471982,"login":"kellyworkos00-droid","node_id":"U_kgDODlVPrg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kellyworkos00-droid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ke