scriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/commits/70278e6e7f07b86c1336b356b82fbf1858fccb2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-08T19:03:04Z","email":"welchs1423@naver.com","name":"welchs1423"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T19:03:04Z","email":"welchs1423@naver.com","name":"welchs1423"},"message":"feat(loom-java): Saga pattern — PENDING→COMPLETED|CANCELED compensating transaction\n\n- OrderStatus: add PENDING (initial Saga state) and COMPLETED (success terminal)\n- OrderEvent: add COMPLETE mapping to OrderStatus.COMPLETED\n- DbStore.insertOrderPending(): INSERT status=PENDING, ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING RETURNING\n- DbStore.updateOrderStatus(): unconditional UPDATE for SagaCoordinator use only\n- SagaCoordinator (new static inner class):\n  - executeSaga() spawns virtual thread saga-<orderId>, returns immediately\n  - runSaga() GET {GATEWAY_URL}/api/clojure/transfer?from=...&to=...&amount=...\n  - connect timeout 5s, per-request timeout 10s\n  - on 2xx: UPDATE status=COMPLETED + Redis SAGA_COMPLETE\n  - on timeout/non-2xx: compensating UPDATE status=CANCELED + Redis SAGA_COMPENSATE\n  - GATEWAY_URL env var (default: http://server-go:8080)\n- POST /api/java/order: accepts from/to/amount params, returns 202 Accepted\n- README: Service Map and Key APIs updated","tree":{"sha":"10346cc94261f71ac0c5988c9427bd1f172d855b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/git/trees/10346cc94261f71ac0c5988c9427bd1f172d855b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/git/commits/70278e6e7f07b86c1336b356b82fbf1858fccb2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92322600?v=4","events_url":"https://a