content.com/u/92322600?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/welchs1423","id":92322600,"login":"welchs1423","node_id":"U_kgDOBYC7KA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/commits/ffba27cf1e19456920ccc892f61992cf9d75061b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-08T18:34:29Z","email":"welchs1423@naver.com","name":"welchs1423"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T18:34:29Z","email":"welchs1423@naver.com","name":"welchs1423"},"message":"feat(apm): custom APM infrastructure — non-blocking collector, central ingest server, correlation ID\n\nloom-java/ApmCollector.java (new)\n- ConcurrentLinkedQueue<TransactionMetric> wait-free producer queue\n- Single apm-drain virtual thread drains batches of 200 every 500ms\n- java.net.http.HttpClient POST to APM server; all I/O errors silently discarded\n- MAX_QUEUE_SIZE=10000 drop-on-full back-pressure; record() is O(1) non-blocking\n\nloom-java/VirtualServer.java\n- ApmCollector.init(APM_URL) at startup\n- X-Correlation-Id header read/generated (UUID v4) per request; echoed on response\n- long[] queryMs per-branch JDBC timing; finally-block fire-and-forget record()\n\nloom-java/build.sh\n- javac target changed from VirtualServer.java to *.java (includes ApmCollector.java)\n\napm-server/server.js (new)\n- Node.js HTTP server :9009; zero external dependencies\n- POST /ingest: JSON array ingest into 100k circular buffer, 202 Accepted\n- GET /metrics?limit=N: p50/p95/p99/avg/max per service + recent N events\n- GET /health: liveness probe (wget-compatible)\n\nserver-go/main.go\n- newCorrelationID(): UUID v4 from crypto/rand\n- withAPM() middleware: X-Correlation-Id inject/propagate + non-blocking apmQueue send\n- startAPMDrainer(): 500ms ticker goroutine, 100-event flush, 3s HTTP timeout\n- ListenAndServe wrapped with withAPM(http.DefaultServeMux)\n\ndocker-compose.yml\n- apm-server service: node:22-alpine, port 9009, healthcheck via wget\n- go-hub, java-loom: APM_URL env var + apm-server service_healthy depends_on","tree":{"sha":"f84972f8f30c0e22a7da5c7f08ca01b59022c023","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/git/trees/f84972f8f30c0e22a7da5c7f08ca01b59022c023"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/git/commits/ffba27cf1e19456920ccc892f61992cf9d75061b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92322600?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/welchs1423","id":92322600,"login":"welchs1423","node_id":"U_kgDOBYC7KA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/starred{/owner}{/