chs1423"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T18:34:14Z","email":"welchs1423@naver.com","name":"welchs1423"},"message":"feat: event-driven WebSocket order feed (Java Loom → Redis Pub/Sub → Go WS Hub → Svelte)\n\n- server-go: gorilla/websocket Hub + Client read/write pump goroutines\n  - wsHandler: HTTP upgrade → WebSocket; registers client into globalHub\n  - startRedisSubscriber: subscribes ''order-events'' channel; auto-reconnects on close\n  - GET /ws route registered in main()\n- loom-java: POST /api/java/order now publishes INSERT event to Redis\n  - fire-and-forget via Thread.ofVirtual after HTTP response committed\n  - payload: { order_id, type, event, prev_status, new_status, timestamp }\n- portal-svelte: Order Event Feed panel below service grid\n  - connectOrderFeed(): auto-reconnect WebSocket client (3s backoff)\n  - orderEvents ring buffer (50 entries), wsStatus badge\n  - table: Order ID / Type / Event / Prev Status / New Status / Time\n- README: architecture diagram, API table, Changelog updated","tree":{"sha":"ed72c6454140ccb5316d27eaf0a93d27d6c213c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/git/trees/ed72c6454140ccb5316d27eaf0a93d27d6c213c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/git/commits/e49b2ef73f6c7c07f37398d7686ac23ad57abb49","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92322600?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/welchs1423","id":92322600,"login":"welchs1423","node_id":"U_kgDOBYC7KA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/orgs","