streamer: embed dependency download inline; remove stale scala_coursier volume\n- ruby-scorer: install webrick; append server.start inline; add ruby_gems volume\n- gleam-hub: bump to v1.14.0; cp to /tmp/gleam-app to avoid ro-volume write conflict\n- elixir-hub: MIX_ENV dev; cp /app /tmp/app before mix compile; add elixir_build volume\n- java-loom: command direct java -cp invocation; volume :ro\n- prolog-solver: swipl:9.2 -> swipl:latest\n- lua-stream: install luasocket via luarocks; run lua (not lua5.4)\n- swift-actor: use swift:6.1-slim; set LD_LIBRARY_PATH\n- kotlin-scheduler: add DB_URL/DB_USER/DB_PASS env vars; depends_on postgres+redis\n- zig-core: replace unofficial image with alpine + manual zig 0.13.0 install\n- rust-pipeline: restart: on-failure\n- volumes: add fsharp_obj, fsharp_bin, elixir_build, gleam_build, julia_depot, r_libs, ruby_gems\n\nhub-elixir/config/config.exs\n- Add ''server: true'' so Phoenix binds on startup\n\nhub_gleam/manifest.toml\n- Remove gleeunit (test-only dependency, not needed in production)\n\npipeline-rust/src/main.rs\n- Read DATABASE_URL from env; hardcoded localhost fallback kept for local dev\n\nscheduler-kotlin/Main.kt + scheduler.jar\n- Read DB_URL/DB_USER/DB_PASS from env vars (const -> val + System.getenv)\n- Recompile jar to match source\n\ntests/load-test.js\n- Add k6 load test script covering all 27 service endpoints\n\n.gitignore\n- Ignore changes.txt","tree":{"sha":"5d45cd8cb134c8ad4047e31a74fc0ee4ddae3a26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/git/trees/5d45cd8cb134c8ad4047e31a74fc0ee4ddae3a26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/git/commits/77dddbf322ee4d534d32cd51ef43752e619a8ded","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92322600?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https:/