ers/welchs1423","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/commits/ce341b360ae6f53df398298b3c3a79fea3a14a7c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-08T08:01:25Z","email":"welchs1423@naver.com","name":"welchs1423"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T08:01:25Z","email":"welchs1423@naver.com","name":"welchs1423"},"message":"feat(java): add HikariCP JDBC persistence and PROCESSING state to VirtualServer\n\nVirtualServer.java:\n- DbStore inner class: HikariCP connection pool (maxPoolSize=20, timeout=3s)\n- upsertPostgres: INSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE (single statement, row-level lock)\n- upsertOracle: MERGE INTO USING DUAL (single statement, row-level lock)\n- autoCommit=true minimises lock hold time on both DB engines\n- In-memory fallback when DB is unreachable at startup\n- OrderStatus: ORDERED->PAID->PROCESSING->SHIPPED->DELIVERED, CANCELED->REFUNDED\n- OrderEvent: added PROCESS event targeting PROCESSING state\n- DB upsert called after Lock release to keep lock hold time minimal\n- GET /api/java/status exposes db_connected and db_url fields\n- DbStore.getEnv exposed as package-accessible helper\n\nREADME.md:\n- Row 26 (Java 21): add PROCESSING state, ReentrantLock pinning note,\n  HikariCP + JDBC DB persistence detail (PostgreSQL/Oracle, fallback)","tree":{"sha":"800c5f8a2c9961ec0ead5bca4e51ebab1cfcc89a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/git/trees/800c5f8a2c9961ec0ead5bca4e51ebab1cfcc89a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/git/commits/ce341b360ae6f53df398298b3c3a79fea3a14a7c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92322600?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/followers","following_url":"https://ap