_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/commits/b38d8cd88718dba51fccbe662ff8305c7525e648/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-08T07:59:33Z","email":"welchs1423@naver.com","name":"welchs1423"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T07:59:33Z","email":"welchs1423@naver.com","name":"welchs1423"},"message":"feat(brain-python): CoreBridge ctypes wrapper + FastAPI matrix/portfolio endpoints\n\n- core_bridge.py: CoreBridge class wrapping all 8 libcore.so symbols\n  - calculator.cpp: print_status, extreme_computation\n  - matrix.cpp: mat_multiply, mat_multiply_alloc+mat_free,\n    covariance_matrix, cholesky_decompose, mat_vec_mul,\n    portfolio_variance, mat_frobenius_norm\n  - CoreBridgeError for C-side error propagation\n  - strict shape validation before every ctypes call\n- main.py v7: replaces raw ctypes with CoreBridge\n  - POST /api/matrix/multiply  (C=A*B + Frobenius norm)\n  - POST /api/matrix/covariance (unbiased cov + equal-weight vol)\n  - POST /api/matrix/cholesky  (422 on non-SPD input)\n  - POST /api/portfolio/variance (variance + daily/annual vol)\n  - Pydantic request models with field_validator\n  - _require_cpp() returns HTTP 503 when libcore.so absent\n- README: Python service row updated, new endpoints added to Key APIs\n  table, changelog entry","tree":{"sha":"0197a72fcdefd28d4a74eceb4c1d6aabcf88270c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/git/trees/0197a72fcdefd28d4a74eceb4c1d6aabcf88270c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/git/commits/b38d8cd88718dba51fccbe662ff8305c7525e648","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","s