y/commits/ec6c16c597aac92ae782637643c3f47c33dfad38"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92322600?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/welchs1423","id":92322600,"login":"welchs1423","node_id":"U_kgDOBYC7KA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/commits/7b3c97a75d0103658ccf1a6e3b8788bc79d8a51f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-07T17:33:37Z","email":"welchs1423@naver.com","name":"welchs1423"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-07T17:33:37Z","email":"welchs1423@naver.com","name":"welchs1423"},"message":"feat(haskell+ocaml): Servant /price API + OCaml pattern-match loan/margin engine\n\npricer-haskell/server.hs:\n- raw Network.Socket -> Servant + Warp HTTP 프레임워크 전환\n- DataKinds/TypeOperators 타입레벨 API 정의\n- /price: Black-Scholes call/put/delta/gamma/vega/theta (순수 함수, 부수효과 없음)\n- /montecarlo: GBM Monte Carlo (LCG + Box-Muller, seed=42)\n- /stream: 무한 레이지 GBM 스트림 (iterate/scanl/zipWith)\n- BSResult/MCResult/StreamResult Generic 기반 ToJSON 자동 직렬화\n- /api/haskell/* 역방향 호환 라우트 유지 (Go 리버스 프록시)\n\npricer-haskell/pricer-haskell.cabal:\n- aeson >= 2.0, servant-server >= 0.19, warp >= 3.3 의존성 등록\n\nrisk-ocaml/server.ml:\n- applicant 레코드 타입 (cred_score/debt_ratio/collateral_ratio/leverage/income/missed_payments)\n- loan_decision ADT: Approved | ConditionalApproval of string | Rejected of string\n- margin_status ADT: Safe | MarginWarning | MarginCall | ForcedLiquidation\n- evaluate_loan: exhaustive pattern match + when guard 6단계 신용 심사\n- evaluate_margin: pattern match 4단계 마진콜 에스컬레이션 (Basel III 기준)\n- /api/ocaml/loan, /api/ocaml/margincall HTTP 엔드포인트 추가\n\nrisk-ocaml/dune, risk-ocaml/dune-project:\n- Dune 3.0 빌드 설정 (unix 라이브러리, 외부 패키지 무의존)\n\nREADME.md: 서비스맵 및 changelog 업데이트\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a8c440e8f239e32363f222cbf566a3cac13edc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/git/trees/5a8c440e8f239e32363f222cbf566a3cac13edc7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/git/commits/7b3c97a75d0103658ccf1a6e3b8788bc79d8a51f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92322600?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/welchs1423","id":92322600,"login":"welchs1423","node_id":"U_kgDOBYC7KA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://gith