erseProxy + shared transport\n  ResponseHeaderTimeout 30s, reused across all 27 proxy instances\n- withCORS: CORS headers on every proxied response, OPTIONS short-circuit\n- Register 22 canonical language routes (/api/python/ .. /api/kotlin/)\n- Register 5 role aliases: /api/risk/ /api/pricer/ /api/analytics/\n  /api/ledger/ /api/scheduler/\n- README: Architecture proxy map, Key APIs table, Service Map, Changelog","tree":{"sha":"24d4e8cd2f66c80a34434b313a880b253d93ad27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/git/trees/24d4e8cd2f66c80a34434b313a880b253d93ad27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/git/commits/d735e56185db3e0b67bd223e8c0fea7424052887","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92322600?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/welchs1423","id":92322600,"login":"welchs1423","node_id":"U_kgDOBYC7KA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/welchs1423","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/welchs1423/polyglot-infinity/commit/d735e56185db3e0b67bd223e8c0fea7424052887","node_id":"C_kwDORQTD7NoAKGQ3MzVlNTYxODVkYjNlMGI2N2JkMjIzZThjMGZlYTc0MjQwNTI4ODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https