 Super App with micro-frontend architecture\n\n- Implemented modular Super App with Expo SDK 54 + TypeScript\n- Created 3 micro-frontends: Shopping, Booking, Dashboard\n- Each mini-app has independent navigation stack\n- Shopping integrates Fake Store API with product listing & details\n- Booking manages appointments with list, detail, and new booking screens\n- Dashboard features overview, analytics, and activity screens\n- Added MicroAppLoader with smooth loading animations\n- Implemented authentication context with dummy login\n- Bottom tabs hidden in micro-frontends for standalone experience\n- Back buttons navigate to Services tab from each mini-app","tree":{"sha":"913ccce4ff31d19064b9b8f10ff652db8a8472cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Eli-Keli/life-hub-super-app/git/trees/913ccce4ff31d19064b9b8f10ff652db8a8472cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Eli-Keli/life-hub-super-app/git/commits/8d90f2f24174b3b6e8a512f0240ac8d4ea3d8c57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144019567?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eli-Keli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eli-Keli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eli-Keli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eli-Keli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Eli-Keli","id":144019567,"login":"Eli-Keli","node_id":"U_kgDOCJWQbw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eli-Keli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eli-Keli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eli-Keli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eli-Keli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eli-Keli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eli-Keli","user_view_type":"public"