k 23-p2)\n\n- Create TasksViewModel with Signals for presentation logic\n  - UI state management (selectedTaskId, isCreatingTask, filterText)\n  - Computed signals (tasksByStatus, taskCounts, canAddToDoing, filteredTasks)\n  - Actions (create, update, delete, move, select, filter)\n  - Effects (auto-load on auth, error logging)\n  - WIP limit validation (max 2 tasks in DOING)\n\n- Create TasksComponent (smart container)\n  - MVVM pattern implementation\n  - Event handlers delegating to ViewModel\n  - Kanban board with 3 columns (TODO, DOING, DONE)\n  - Visual states (loading, error, empty, success)\n  - Create task modal with form\n  - Search/filter functionality\n  - Cognitive accessibility tokens (uiDensity, focusMode, contentMode)\n  - Responsive design (mobile-first)\n\n- Fix ButtonComponent to support form submission\n  - Add native button element with type attribute\n  - Remove HostListener, use direct click binding\n  - Reset native button styles to inherit from host\n  - Fix preventDefault blocking form submit\n\n- Update entry routes to use TasksComponent as main view\n\nRelated to: Task 23-p2 (Tasks Component Smart Container)\nDependencies: Task 22 (TasksStore), Task 08 (AuthStore), Task 09 (PreferencesStore)","tree":{"sha":"21cbce1e4c9a90b22936ee2c13d0ff270f258b83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/git/trees/21cbce1e4c9a90b22936ee2c13d0ff270f258b83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/git/commits/ce82ecb1fa73d24bb233563319b9181a90198ccd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27739644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/gists