"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/commits/eb6a297cf89f2fa5853d3b9451b5b3cba0cc5ebf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-16T20:23:45Z","email":"gegiorgio1991@gmail.com","name":"Giorgio Costa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-16T20:23:45Z","email":"gegiorgio1991@gmail.com","name":"Giorgio Costa"},"message":"feat(mfe-tasks): implement complete TasksStore with Signals (Task 22)\n\n🎯 IMPLEMENTAÇÃO COMPLETA:\n\n1. **Task Models** (task.model.ts)\n   - Interface Task com todos os campos\n   - CreateTaskDto, UpdateTaskDto, MoveTaskDto\n   - TasksResponse com paginação\n\n2. **TasksStore** (tasks.store.ts)\n   - State management com Angular Signals\n   - Private writable signals (_tasks, _loading, _error, _statusFilter, _searchTerm)\n   - Public readonly signals (tasks, loading, error)\n   - Computed signals (filteredTasks, todoTasks, doingTasks, doneTasks, stats)\n   - CRUD completo (loadTasks, createTask, updateTask, deleteTask, getTaskById)\n   - Drag & drop support (moveTask com optimistic updates)\n   - Filter actions (setStatusFilter, setSearchTerm, clearFilters)\n   - HttpClient integration com firstValueFrom\n   - Error handling e optimistic updates\n\n3. **TasksListComponent** (tasks-list.component.ts)\n   - Atualizado para usar TasksStore completo\n   - Display de estatísticas (total, todo, doing, done, completion rate)\n   - Preview Kanban com 3 colunas\n   - Loading e error states\n   - Styled components\n\n4. **Unit Tests** (tasks.store.spec.ts)\n   - 13 testes implementados e PASSANDO ✅\n   - Testes de CRUD (load, create, update, delete)\n   - Testes de computed signals\n   - Testes de filter actions\n   - HttpClientTestingModule\n\n5. **Progress Update** (passo-passo.html)\n   - 22/34 tasks completadas (65%)\n   - Phase 6 iniciada (2/7 tasks)\n\n📊 COBERTURA:\n- Store completo: 380 linhas\n- Tests: 13 passing\n- Models: 4 interfaces DTOs\n- Lint: 9 warnings (acceptable - error handling any types)","tree":{"sha":"2449ce234c342da5692c7b59f3863eefa72c8128","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/git/trees/2449ce234c342da5692c7b59f3863eefa72c8128"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/git/commits/eb6a297cf89f2fa5853d3b9451b5b3cba0cc5ebf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27739644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/giorgiocost","id":27739644,"login":"giorgiocost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NzM5NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/commit/eb6a297cf89f2fa5853d3b9451b5b3cba0cc5ebf","node_id":"C_kwDORQlxx9oAKGViNmEyOTdjZjg5ZjJmYTU4NTNkM2I5NDUxYjViM2NiYTBjYzVlYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/commit/25734bf7b375f97b38ffe1d0bd76f3d58e2eafb7","sha":"25734bf7b375f97b38ffe1d0bd76f3d58e2eafb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repo