n4. **Removed Problematic shared-ui Component**\n   - Deleted entire libs/shared/ui/src/lib/shared-ui/ directory\n   - Removed shared-ui export from main index.ts\n\n🎯 Result: All 4 MFE applications (host-shell, mfe-dashboard, mfe-profile, mfe-tasks)\nnow compile and serve successfully without errors.\n\nDevelopment environment fully operational for continued work.","tree":{"sha":"3e7794b5e29df4da2ba01dd91939b2895edf94ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/git/trees/3e7794b5e29df4da2ba01dd91939b2895edf94ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/git/commits/c0518686ea17d22be42bb26e541bebc152888988","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27739644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/giorgiocost","id":27739644,"login":"giorgiocost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NzM5NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/commit/c0518686ea17d22be42bb26e541bebc152888988","node_id":"C_kwDORQlxx9oAKGMwNTE4Njg2ZWExN2QyMmJlNDJiYjI2ZTU0MWJlYmMxNTI4ODg5ODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/commit/9c62c763e26c60e0167cdec7f7acc23b1de1ef03","sha":"9c62c763e26c60e0167cdec7f7acc23b1de1ef03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/commits/9c62c763e26c60e0167cdec7f7acc23b1de1ef03"}],"sha":"c0518686ea17d22be42bb26e541bebc152888988","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/commits/c0518686ea17d22be42bb26e541bebc152888988"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27739644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/giorgiocost","id":27739644,"login":"giorgiocost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NzM5NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/commits/9c62c763e26c60e0167cdec7f7acc23b1de1ef03/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-16T17:26:00Z","email":"gegiorgio1991@gmail.com","name":"Giorgio Costa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-16T17:26:00Z","email":"gegiorgio1991@gmail.com","name":"Giorgio Costa"},"message":"feat: Task 20 - Preferences Panel Component for Cognitive Accessibility\n\n✨ NEW FEATURES:\n- PreferencesPanelComponent with 7 cognitive accessibility controls\n- Real-time preference updates via PreferencesStore integration\n- 3 predefined presets: \"Foco Máximo\", \"Leitura Confortável\", \"Padrão\"\n- Comprehensive ARIA labeling and keyboard accessibility\n\n🎛️ CONTROLS IMPLEMENTED:\n- UI Density: button group (Simple/Medium/Full)\n- Focus Mode: toggle switch with loading states\n- Content Mode: button group (Summary/Detailed)\n- Contrast: button group (Low/Normal/High)\n- Font Scale: range slider (0.9x - 1.4x)\n- Spacing Scale: range slider (0.9x - 1.4x)\n- Motion: button group (Full/Reduced/Off)\n\n🎨 STYLING & UX:\n- 480+ lines of SCSS with hover effects and transitions\n- Responsive design for mobile and desktop\n- Motion preference handling (respects user settings)\n- Loading states and skeleton animations\n- Cross-browser slider styling (webkit/moz prefixes)\n\n🧪 TESTING:\n- 17 comprehensive unit tests for PreferencesPanelComponent\n- MockPreferencesStore for isolated testing\n- Updated DashboardComponent tests (49 total tests passing)\n- Proper ARIA attributes and accessibility testing\n\n🔌 INTEGRATION:\n- Updated DashboardComponent to use PreferencesPanel\n- Type-safe integration with @shared/state dependency\n- Real-time updates without page refresh\n- Preset configurations apply instantly\n\n📁 FILES MODIFIED:\n- apps/mfe-dashboard/src/app/components/preferences-panel/ (4 files)\n- apps/mfe-dashboard/src/app/dashboard/dashboard.component.ts\n- apps/mfe-dashboard/src/app/dashboard/dashboard.component.html\n- apps/mfe-dashboard/src/app/dashboard/dashboard.component.spec.ts\n\nTask 20 provides ADHD-friendly cognitive accessibility customization\nintegrated into the dashboard for immediate preference adjustments.","tree":{"sha":"ff434811817320c0d4c2fa1eef54dd79fd5ad32d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/git/trees/ff434811817320c0d4c2fa1eef54dd79fd5ad32d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/git/commits/9c62c763e26c60e0167cdec7f7acc23b1de1ef03","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar