de directive to close dropdown\n- Responsive design (hide text on mobile < 640px)\n- Output event for sidebar toggle\n- Motion preferences support\n\n� Tests\n- 27 comprehensive unit tests covering all features\n- User data display and initials calculation\n- Sidebar toggle output emission\n- Dropdown open/close behavior\n- Navigation actions (profile, preferences, library)\n- Logout with AuthStore integration\n- Notifications badge visibility\n- Accessibility attributes (aria-label, aria-expanded, aria-haspopup)\n\n� Implementation\n- TypeScript: 95 lines with Signals API and output()\n- HTML: 75 lines with @if control flow\n- SCSS: 240 lines with flexbox, animations, responsive\n- Tests: 260+ lines with proper change detection\n- ClickOutside directive: 33 lines (reusable)\n\n� Technical Details\n- User computed signal from AuthStore.user()\n- userInitials computed with first + last logic\n- Router.navigate for menu actions\n- AuthStore.logout for logout action\n- Click outside event handling\n- Focus-visible styles for keyboard navigation\n\nRelated: Task 14 (Phase 4 - Layout & Navigation)\nPrerequisites: Task 04 (ButtonComponent), Task 08 (AuthStore), Task 13 (LayoutComponent)","tree":{"sha":"cb14a5a497a1471f121e79008a551459fa17d5b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/git/trees/cb14a5a497a1471f121e79008a551459fa17d5b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/git/commits/b2585a07119f5a46d8698bc43350cf708db2cd3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27739644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url"