le collision errors\n\n- Added comprehensive routing tests (14 tests passing):\n  - Public route loading\n  - Protected route guards\n  - Default redirects\n  - Route configuration validation\n\nAll tests passing (14/14).\nRelates to Task 16: Configure Routing","tree":{"sha":"3ce504998317d017d0a2a8fe2904150e3bc0ad5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/git/trees/3ce504998317d017d0a2a8fe2904150e3bc0ad5e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/git/commits/ed4a3cf686fd4bfe38c3c93ff831836ea41424c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27739644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/giorgiocost","id":27739644,"login":"giorgiocost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NzM5NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/commit/ed4a3cf686fd4bfe38c3c93ff831836ea41424c8","node_id":"C_kwDORQlxx9oAKGVkNGEzY2Y2ODZmZDRiZmUzOGMzYzkzZmY4MzE4MzZlYTQxNDI0Yzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/commit/623b060b5efc95eac68b5e985cfc44f91947675f","sha":"623b060b5efc95eac68b5e985cfc44f91947675f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/commits/623b060b5efc95eac68b5e985cfc44f91947675f"}],"sha":"ed4a3cf686fd4bfe38c3c93ff831836ea41424c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/commits/ed4a3cf686fd4bfe38c3c93ff831836ea41424c8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27739644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/giorgiocost","id":27739644,"login":"giorgiocost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NzM5NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/commits/623b060b5efc95eac68b5e985cfc44f91947675f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-16T05:26:28Z","email":"gegiorgio1991@gmail.com","name":"Giorgio Costa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-16T05:26:28Z","email":"gegiorgio1991@gmail.com","name":"Giorgio Costa"},"message":"feat(shared-guards): implement auth guard (Task 12)\n\nCreates functional route guard for protecting authenticated routes.\n\nFeatures:\n- Checks authentication status via AuthStore.isAuthenticated()\n- Blocks access to protected routes when not authenticated\n- Redirects to /login when access is denied\n- Saves intended URL to sessionStorage for post-login redirect\n- Helper functions: getReturnUrl(), clearReturnUrl()\n- Full URL preservation (path, query params, fragments)\n\nImplementation details:\n- Functional guard (CanActivateFn pattern)\n- Integrates with AuthStore using inject()\n- Uses sessionStorage for return URL (not persisted across sessions)\n- Router navigation for redirect flow\n\nArchitecture:\n- New library: shared-guards (@shared/guards)\n- ADR-002: MVVM + Signals integration\n- Task 08: AuthStore dependency\n\nTesting:\n- 15/15 unit tests passing\n- Tests cover: auth checks, redirect logic, URL management\n- All edge cases validated (root URL, query params, fragments, multiple executions)\n\nFiles:\n- libs/shared/guards/ (new library via nx generate)\n  - src/lib/auth.guard.ts (99 lines)\n  - src/lib/auth.guard.spec.ts (198 lines, 14 tests)\n  - src/index.ts (exports)\n- tsconfig.base.json (path mapping for @shared/guards)\n\nRelated:\n- Task 12: Implement Auth Guard\n- Task 08: AuthStore (dependency)\n- ADR-002: MVVM + Signals architecture\n\nUsage:\n// apps/host-shell/src/app/app.routes.ts\nimport { authGuard } from ''@shared/guards'';\nexport const routes: Routes = [\n  {\n    path: ''dashboard'',\n    component: DashboardComponent,\n    canActivate: [authGuard]\n  }\n];\n\n// In login component after successful authentication:\nimport { getReturnUrl, clearReturnUrl } from ''@shared/guards'';\nconst returnUrl = getReturnUrl() || ''/dashboard'';\nclearReturnUrl();\nthis.router.navigateByUrl(returnUrl);","tree":{"sha":"25ad0e22b2131d2cf8e411b241659de1257c43cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/git/trees/25ad0e22b2131d2cf8e411b241659de1257c43cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/git/commits/623b060b5efc95eac68b5e985cfc44f91947675f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27739644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/user