organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/commits/f7b80cb94bb0328d7d729e45b6cd410be19675ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-16T05:22:22Z","email":"gegiorgio1991@gmail.com","name":"Giorgio Costa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-16T05:22:22Z","email":"gegiorgio1991@gmail.com","name":"Giorgio Costa"},"message":"feat(shared-http): implement auth interceptor (Task 11)\n\nCreates HTTP interceptor that handles JWT authentication automatically.\n\nFeatures:\n- Adds Authorization Bearer token to authenticated requests\n- Adds X-Correlation-Id header for request tracing (crypto.randomUUID)\n- Skips auth header for public endpoints (/auth/login, /auth/register, /auth/refresh)\n- Automatic token refresh on 401 errors\n- Retries failed request with new token after refresh\n- Logs out and redirects to /login if refresh fails\n- Pass-through for non-401 errors\n\nImplementation details:\n- Functional interceptor (HttpInterceptorFn pattern)\n- Integrates with AuthStore (inject pattern)\n- RxJS operators: catchError, switchMap, throwError, from\n- Router navigation for logout redirect\n\nArchitecture:\n- New library: shared-http (@shared/http)\n- ADR-002: MVVM + Signals integration\n- Task 08: AuthStore dependency\n\nTesting:\n- 11/11 unit tests passing\n- Tests cover: headers, auth states, refresh flow, error handling\n- All edge cases validated (public endpoints, 401, non-401, refresh failure)\n\nFiles:\n- libs/shared/http/ (new library via nx generate)\n  - src/lib/interceptors/auth.interceptor.ts (98 lines)\n  - src/lib/interceptors/auth.interceptor.spec.ts (244 lines, 11 tests)\n  - src/index.ts (exports)\n- tsconfig.base.json (path mapping for @shared/http)\n\nRelated:\n- Task 11: Implement Auth Interceptor\n- Task 08: AuthStore (dependency)\n- ADR-002: MVVM + Signals architecture\n\nUsage:\n// apps/host-shell/src/app/app.config.ts\nimport { authInterceptor } from ''@shared/http'';\nexport const appConfig = {\n  providers: [\n    provideHttpClient(withInterceptors([authInterceptor]))\n  ]\n};","tree":{"sha":"229076a9815f184dec6392d4ce678021da1ea81f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/git/trees/229076a9815f184dec6392d4ce678021da1ea81f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/git/commits/f7b80cb94bb0328d7d729e45b6cd410be19675ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27739644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/giorgiocost","id":27739644,"login":"giorgiocost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NzM5NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/commit/f7b80cb94bb0328d7d729e45b6cd410be19675ec","node_id":"C_kwDORQlxx9oAKGY3YjgwY2I5NGJiMDMyOGQ3ZDcyOWU0NWI2Y2Q0MTBiZTE5Njc1ZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/commit/7579f10cfa9d45d786e578bf7885614755acc451","sha":"7579f10cfa9d45d786e578bf7885614755acc451","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/commits/7579f10cfa9d45d786e578bf7885614755acc451"}],"sha":"f7b80cb94bb0328d7d729e45b6cd410be19675ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/commits/f7b80cb94bb0328d7d729e45b6cd410be19675ec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27739644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/giorgiocost","id":27739644,"login":"giorgiocost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NzM5NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/commits/7579f10cfa9d45d786e578bf7885614755acc451/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-16T05:15:51Z","email":"gegiorgio1991@gmail.com","name":"Giorgio Costa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-16T05:15:51Z","email":"gegiorgio1991@gmail.com","name":"Giorgio Costa"},"message":"docs: add ADR-002 MVVM + Signals and update ADR-003\n\nCreates ADR-002 documenting MVVM + Signals architecture pattern:\n- Injectable stores with private/public signals\n- Computed signals for derived state\n- Effects for side effects (DOM, LocalStorage, API)\n- Component integration patterns\n- State persistence strategy\n\nUpdates ADR-003 Cognitive Tokens:\n- Target changed from <html> to <body> (reflects actual implementation)\n- Added PreferencesUiService code example with effect()\n- Added references to ADR-002 and Tasks 08-10\n- Updated initialization flow with LocalStorage + API sync\n- Added implementation status checklist\n\nUpdates docs/README.md:\n- Added ADR-002 link to decisions section\n\nRelated:\n- Task 08: AuthStore implementation (28 tests)\n- Task 09: PreferencesStore implementation (29 tests)\n- Task 10: PreferencesUiService implementation (20 tests)\n\nFiles:\n- docs/decisions/adr-002-mvvm-signals-architecture.md (new, 294 lines)\n- docs/decisions/adr-003-tokens-cognitivos.md (updated)\n- docs/README.md (updated)","tree":{"sha":"f12f16a6eab1dd3a8f3c87318991b77634183408","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/git/trees/f12f16a6eab1dd3a8f3c87318991b77634183408"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/git/commits/7579f10cfa9d45d786e578bf7885614755acc451","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27739644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/giorgiocost","id":27739644,"login":"giorgiocost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NzM5NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giorgiocost/r