os/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/commits/fdef69723b5bd89106c4a43def72a11c23186fd3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-16T05:12:16Z","email":"gegiorgio1991@gmail.com","name":"Giorgio Costa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-16T05:12:16Z","email":"gegiorgio1991@gmail.com","name":"Giorgio Costa"},"message":"feat(shared-ui): implement PreferencesUiService (Task 10)\n\nImplements PreferencesUiService that applies cognitive accessibility\npreferences from PreferencesStore to the DOM using Angular Signals effect().\n\nFeatures:\n- Reactive DOM updates via effect() when preferences change\n- Data attributes on <body> for CSS selectors\n- CSS custom properties (--font-scale, --spacing-scale)\n- Body classes for easier CSS targeting (density-*, focus-mode, etc.)\n- Handles all 7 cognitive preference tokens (ADR-003)\n\nImplementation details:\n- Uses DOCUMENT injection token for DOM access\n- Applies preferences atomically when store updates\n- Safe null check for body element\n- Auto-initializes via APP_INITIALIZER (documented in task file)\n\nTechnical stack:\n- Angular 17+ Signals with effect()\n- PreferencesStore integration\n- DOM API (setAttribute, style.setProperty, classList)\n\nTesting:\n- 20/20 unit tests passing\n- Tests verify data attributes, CSS vars, body classes\n- Tests confirm reactive updates on preference changes\n- Edge cases handled (missing body element)\n\nFiles:\n- libs/shared/ui/src/lib/services/preferences-ui.service.ts (82 lines)\n- libs/shared/ui/src/lib/services/preferences-ui.service.spec.ts (233 lines, 20 tests)\n- libs/shared/ui/src/index.ts (export added)\n\nRelated:\n- Task 10: Setup Preferences UI Service\n- ADR-002: MVVM + Signals architecture\n- ADR-003: Cognitive Tokens specification\n- Depends on: Task 09 (PreferencesStore)\n\nProgress: 10/33 tasks (30%)","tree":{"sha":"57581ffc5cb07bebb3d980c4e34bd12ead7ecfb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/giorgiocost/mind-ease-fiap/git/trees/57581ffc5cb07bebb3d980c4e34bd12ea